# name, description, photo_url, maps_url, state, distance, travel_time, lat, lng
MOSQUES = [
    ('Masjid Putra, Putrajaya', "🕌💗 The breathtaking PINK MOSQUE! Malaysia's most photographed mosque floats ethereally on Putrajaya Lake, its rose-tinted granite facade glowing gold at sunrise and violet at sunset. A stunning fusion of Malay craftsmanship and Persian influence, featuring a soaring 116-metre minaret inspired by Baghdad's Sheikh Omar Mosque. Inside, intricate geometric carvings and elegant columns create a fairytale sanctuary. The view from the lake promenade is absolutely magical! 📸✨", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/masjid-putra', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Putra%2C%20Putrajaya%20Malaysia', 'Putrajaya', '30 km', '35-50 min', 2.9162, 101.7186),
    ('Masjid Sultan Salahuddin Abdul Aziz, Shah Alam', "🔵🕌 The legendary BLUE MOSQUE! Home to one of the world's LARGEST religious domes at 51.2 metres diameter, this majestic structure features mesmerizing blue and silver panels that glint under the sun. Four towering minarets stand guard like sentinels while stained-glass windows bathe the prayer hall in cool blue light. A masterpiece blending modern design with Malay majesty - prepare to be awestruck! 💙🌟", 'https://www.selangor.travel/blue-mosque', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Sultan%20Salahuddin%20Abdul%20Aziz%2C%20Shah%20Alam%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '28 km', '35-50 min', 3.0791, 101.4972),
    ('Masjid Wilayah Persekutuan, KL', "🌿👑 The MOSQUE IN THE GARDEN! Sitting majestically on a hilltop surrounded by a moat and manicured landscapes, this architectural crown features 22 cascading turquoise domes in Ottoman-Malay fusion style. Massive archways open to breeze-filled verandas, reflecting pools create mirror-perfect photo ops, and the prayer hall dazzles with polished marble and crystal chandeliers. Kuala Lumpur's jeweled sanctuary! 🏰✨", 'https://masjidwilayah.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Wilayah%20Persekutuan%2C%20KL%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '10 km', '18-25 min', 3.169, 101.6993),
    ('Masjid Tuanku Mizan Zainal Abidin, Putrajaya', "🔩🕌 The futuristic IRON MOSQUE! Defying traditional design, this sleek modern marvel is built from stainless steel with a woven-mesh 'skin' that lets Putrajaya Lake breezes flow through naturally - no air-conditioning needed! The jaw-dropping 13-metre glass wall inscribed with Quranic verses appears to float in mid-air. At night, colorful lights transform it into a glowing lantern reflecting on the lake. Absolutely sci-fi stunning! 🌃⚡", 'https://www.tourism.gov.my/masjid-besi', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Tuanku%20Mizan%20Zainal%20Abidin%2C%20Putrajaya%20Malaysia', 'Putrajaya', '30 km', '35-50 min', 2.9249, 101.6876),
    ('Masjid Kristal, Kuala Terengganu', "💎✨ A MOSQUE MADE OF GLASS! The Crystal Mosque sparkles like a precious gem on Pulau Wan Man riverbank. Its faceted steel and glass domes catch sunlight creating dazzling reflections - a futuristic silhouette unlike any other. But wait for sunset: LED lights shift from gold to pink to blue, transforming the building into a glowing lantern mirrored in dark river waters. Terengganu's crown jewel! 🌈🌙", 'https://terengganu.travel/crystal-mosque', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Kristal%2C%20Kuala%20Terengganu%20Malaysia', 'Terengganu', '450 km', '5-6 hours', 5.3156, 103.1509),
    ('Masjid Jamek, KL', "🏛️📜 KL's OLDEST MOSQUE! Where two rivers meet at the heart of Kuala Lumpur stands this magnificent 1909 Mughal-inspired masterpiece. Striped onion domes, elegant minarets, and palm-shaded courtyards transport you to another era. This is where KL's story began! The stunning confluence location at Sungai Gombak and Sungai Klang makes it historically and visually significant. A must-visit heritage landmark! 🕰️🌴", 'https://www.visitkl.gov.my/masjid-jamek', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Jamek%2C%20KL%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '8-12 min', 3.1582, 101.688),
    ('Masjid Ubudiah, Kuala Kangsar', "👑✨ The ROYAL MOSQUE with the Golden Dome! In the royal town of Kuala Kangsar sits this fairytale mosque, its massive golden dome gleaming against the sky like a crown. Moorish and Indian architectural styles blend magnificently, with imported Italian marble and an octagonal prayer hall creating regal elegance. Surrounded by smaller cupolas and soaring minarets, this photographer's dream is fit for royalty! 👸🌟", 'https://www.perak.travel/masjid-ubudiah', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Ubudiah%2C%20Kuala%20Kangsar%20Malaysia', 'Perak', '230 km', '2.5-3 hours', 4.5891, 101.1039),
    ('Masjid Sendayan, Negeri Sembilan', '🤍🏰 The TAJ MAHAL of Malaysia! Pristine white exterior, pearlescent domes, and soaring minarets create regal purity rivaling the Mughal masterpiece. Inside is a dazzling showcase of Middle Eastern craftsmanship - intricate wood carvings, imported marble, and calligraphy embellished with 24-karat GOLD plating! Sunlight through stained glass creates mesmerizing kaleidoscopes of colour. Simply breathtaking! ✨💛', 'https://www.n9.gov.my/masjid-sendayan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Sendayan%2C%20Negeri%20Sembilan%20Malaysia', 'Negeri Sembilan', '70 km', '1-1.5 hours', 2.7363, 101.9428),
    ('Islamic Arts Museum Malaysia, KL', "🎨📚 The WORLD'S FINEST Islamic arts collection! Over 7,000 masterpieces spanning 1,400 years await - intricate calligraphy, dazzling textiles, ancient Qurans, and architectural models of famous mosques worldwide. The museum building itself is a masterpiece with soaring domes and geometric patterns. Every corner offers new wonders where history, beauty, and spirituality dance together in perfect harmony! 🕌💫", 'https://www.iamm.org.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Islamic%20Arts%20Museum%20Malaysia%2C%20KL%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '10-15 min', 3.1172, 101.6703),
    ('Masjid Bandaraya Kota Kinabalu, Sabah', "🌊🕌 The FLOATING MOSQUE of Sabah! Perched on Likas Bay lagoon, this mosque appears to rest weightlessly on water's surface. Blue and gold domes pay homage to the Prophet's Mosque in Medina, while white walls glow against fiery sunset skies. The calm water creates a perfect mirror reflection doubling its beauty. Fresh sea breeze flows through the open-sided prayer hall - pure serenity where architecture meets nature! 🌅💙", 'https://www.sabahtourism.com/city-mosque', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Bandaraya%20Kota%20Kinabalu%2C%20Sabah%20Malaysia', 'Sabah', '1,600 km', 'Flight 2.5 hrs', 5.9619, 116.0619),
    ('Masjid Habib, Penang', "💎🏮 Where Chinese heritage meets Islamic architecture! Built by the famous Habib Jewels family, this stunning mosque features a unique DIAMOND-CUT dome sparkling in the sun. Minarets inspired by Chinese lanterns (tanglung) and interior celebrating Jawi Peranakan heritage make it culturally unique. The prayer hall glows with geometric motifs like a jewelry box come to life! Tanjung Tokong's ethereal landmark! 🌟🎎", 'https://www.penang.gov.my/masjid-habib', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Habib%2C%20Penang%20Malaysia', 'Penang', '350 km', '4-5 hours', 5.4102, 100.3395),
    ('Masjid Zabedah (ISTAC), KL', "🇪🇸🕌 A piece of ANDALUSIAN SPAIN in KL! Hidden in Bukit Tunku's leafy hills, this best-kept secret feels like a lost Granada palace. Elegant Moorish arches, zellij tilework, and a serene courtyard with a 12-pointed star fountain - direct nods to the Alhambra! The trickling water and rustling trees transport you straight to Southern Spain. A quiet scholarly sanctuary of unmatched beauty! 🌿🏰", 'https://www.istac.edu.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Zabedah%20(ISTAC)%2C%20KL%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '8 km', '15-25 min', 3.1114, 101.7103),
    ('Masjid Negeri Sarawak, Kuching', "🌟🕌 Sarawak's GOLDEN-DOMED crown jewel! Rising majestically beside the Sarawak River, the State Mosque welcomes up to 5,000 worshippers beneath a shimmering golden dome visible across the whole city. Contemporary Sarawakian motifs blend with classic Islamic design, while the riverside promenade out front turns sunset visits into pure magic. Kuching's most photographed skyline landmark! 🌇🏞️", 'https://sarawak.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Negeri%20Sarawak%20Kuching%20Malaysia', 'Sarawak', '1,450 km', 'Flight 2 hrs', 1.5496, 110.3507),
    ('Masjid Muhammadi, Kota Bharu', "🏛️🕌 Kelantan's HISTORIC royal mosque! Built in 1867 and rebuilt in striking brick-red brickwork after a fire, Masjid Muhammadi anchors Kota Bharu's Islamic Heritage Zone alongside royal palaces and craft museums. As one of Malaysia's oldest mosques, it stands at the heart of the 'Cradle of Malay Culture' - a living reminder of Kelantan's deep Islamic scholarly tradition! 📜✨", 'https://www.kelantan.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Masjid%20Muhammadi%20Kota%20Bharu%20Malaysia', 'Kelantan', '480 km', '6-7 hours', 6.1290, 102.2589),
]

