ATTRACTIONS = [
    ('Places to Visit', 'Petronas Twin Tower', "🏙️ Prepare to be awestruck! The Petronas Twin Towers pierce the Kuala Lumpur skyline like twin silver rockets frozen mid-launch. At 88 storeys high, this architectural marvel offers heart-pounding views from its double-decker Sky Bridge—where the city sprawls beneath you like a glittering carpet. Pro tip: arrive at dawn to snag limited passes and watch the sunrise paint the towers gold. Below awaits Suria KLCC's shopping paradise, the mesmerizing Aquaria KLCC, and the serene KLCC Park—perfect for a sunset stroll past dancing fountains.", 'https://www.petronastwintowers.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Petronas%20Twin%20Tower%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0 km', 'At KLCC', 3.1285, 101.6618),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Pewter Museum at the Royal Selangor Visitor Centre', "🏺 Discover Malaysia's hidden treasure—literally! Royal Selangor Visitor Centre reveals the secrets of pewter-making dating back to 1885. Watch master craftsmen transform molten metal into art, try your hand at hammering your own creation, and explore a museum glittering with antique treasures. Dress up in period costumes for unforgettable photos, then browse the world's largest pewter showroom. It's hands-on history that you can actually take home!", 'https://www.royalselangor.com/visitor-centre', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pewter%20Museum%20at%20the%20Royal%20Selangor%20Visitor%20Centre%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '12 km', '20-30 min', 3.0782, 101.4937),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Central Market', "🎨 Travel back to 1928 and discover KL's creative soul! Central Market (Pasar Seni) pulses with artistic energy—from hand-painted batik unfurling like butterfly wings to master craftsmen carving stories in wood. Haggle for treasures in this beautifully restored Art Deco building, catch live cultural performances, and taste authentic Malaysian flavors at bustling food stalls. It's not just shopping—it's stepping into a living, breathing canvas of Malaysian heritage!", 'https://www.centralmarket.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Central%20Market%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '10-15 min', 3.125, 101.6877),
    ('Places to Visit', 'KL Bird Park', "🦜 Welcome to the world's largest free-flight aviary—where 3,000 feathered friends from 200 species call the treetops home! KL Bird Park isn't a zoo—it's their kingdom, and you're the visitor. Watch hornbills swoop overhead, feed friendly parrots from your palm, and discover rare birds you've never imagined existed. Spanning 21 acres of lush tropical paradise, this is where nature puts on its most colorful show daily. Bring your camera—these divas love the spotlight!", 'https://www.klbirdpark.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/KL%20Bird%20Park%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '10-15 min', 3.1483, 101.68),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Kuala Lumpur Tower', "☁️ Float above the clouds at the legendary KL Tower! Standing 421 metres tall atop Bukit Nanas Forest Reserve, this needle in the sky offers views that'll make your jaw drop—literally 100 metres higher than the Petronas Sky Bridge. Watch planes glide past at eye level, spot landmarks like tiny toys below, and feel the thrill of being on top of Malaysia's world. Early birds catch free tickets, so set that alarm and prepare for a sky-high adventure you'll never forget!", 'https://kltower.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kuala%20Lumpur%20Tower%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '2 km', '5-10 min', 3.1377, 101.6762),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Aquaria KLCC', "🐠 Dive into Malaysia's underwater wonderland without getting wet! Aquaria KLCC plunges you 90 metres through a living ocean inside a spectacular glass tunnel. Watch sharks glide inches above your head, marvel at alien-like jellyfish pulsing with light, and meet over 5,000 aquatic creatures from piranha to giant groupers. Feed stingrays, touch starfish, and witness divers swimming with tiger sharks. This is the ocean's greatest show—and you're right in the middle of it!", 'https://www.aquariaklcc.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Aquaria%20KLCC%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0.3 km', '5 min walk', 3.1106, 101.7084),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Islamic Arts Museum', "✨ Step into a world where art tells the story of civilizations! The Islamic Arts Museum is a breathtaking treasure trove featuring 7,000 masterpieces spanning 1,400 years. Marvel at intricate calligraphy, dazzling textiles, and architectural models of the world's most famous mosques. The building itself is a masterpiece—with soaring domes and geometric patterns that'll have you reaching for your camera at every turn. This is where history, beauty, and spirituality dance together in perfect harmony.", 'https://www.iamm.org.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Islamic%20Arts%20Museum%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '10-15 min', 3.1208, 101.7094),
    ('Places to Visit', 'China Town', '🏮 Lose yourself in the electric energy of Chinatown after dark! Petaling Street explodes into life as neon signs flicker on, hawkers call out bargains, and the aroma of sizzling street food fills the air. Haggle for designer knockoffs, slurp legendary noodles, and discover ancient temples tucked between market stalls. This is where old-world charm meets modern hustle—a feast for every sense that keeps KL locals and travelers coming back night after night!', 'https://www.malaysia.travel/explore/petaling-street', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/China%20Town%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '10-15 min', 3.1664, 101.6663),
    ('Places to Visit', 'National Museum', "🏛️ Where Malaysia's story comes alive! The National Museum isn't just exhibits—it's a time machine disguised as a Malay palace. Wander through prehistoric jungles where ancient humans roamed, witness sultans rise and fall, and see how traditions shaped a nation. Traditional costumes sparkle under lights, ancient instruments await phantom players, and ceremonial weapons tell tales of battles past. Every gallery is a new chapter in Malaysia's incredible journey through time.", 'https://www.jmm.gov.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/National%20Museum%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '5 km', '12-18 min', 3.1361, 101.6743),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Jamek Mosque', '🕌 Stand where two rivers became one city! Jamek Mosque rises gracefully at the birthplace of Kuala Lumpur, its onion domes and Moorish arches reflected in the meeting waters of the Klang and Gombak rivers. Built in 1909, this tranquil sanctuary offers a peaceful escape from urban chaos. Join guided tours, witness call to prayer echoing across the waters, and understand why this sacred spot was chosen to birth a capital. History flows here—literally!', 'https://www.malaysia.travel/explore/masjid-jamek', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Jamek%20Mosque%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '8-12 min', 3.1158, 101.6588),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Kuala Lumpur Butterfly Park', '🦋 Enter an enchanted realm where 15,000 butterflies dance among tropical flowers! KL Butterfly Park is a living rainbow—120 species of delicate beauties fluttering through waterfalls, over lily ponds, and right past your amazed face. Watch the miracle of metamorphosis in the nursery, discover exotic insects that look like aliens, and find your inner peace in this secret garden hidden in the heart of the city. Time slows down here—let the butterflies guide you.', 'https://www.klbutterflypark.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kuala%20Lumpur%20Butterfly%20Park%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '10-15 min', 3.1097, 101.6797),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Kuala Lumpur Railway Station', '🚂 All aboard the time machine! Kuala Lumpur Railway Station is a stunning love letter to colonial architecture, where Moorish arches meet British engineering in perfect harmony. Completed in 1886, this majestic white beauty now houses a railway museum with gleaming vintage locomotives, antique carriages, and stories of journeys past. Walk the atmospheric platforms, pose with century-old fire engines, and feel the romance of an era when train travel was grand adventure.', 'https://www.ktmb.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kuala%20Lumpur%20Railway%20Station%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '10-15 min', 3.149, 101.6785),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Putrajaya', "🌆 Behold Malaysia's city of the future—today! Putrajaya is where cutting-edge architecture meets Islamic grandeur in a symphony of pink domes, sweeping boulevards, and shimmering lakes. Cruise through the world's first intelligent city, where government buildings look like palaces and bridges seem to float on water. As night falls, the city transforms into a wonderland of lights reflected on mirror-like lakes. This is Malaysia's bold vision made real—come witness tomorrow!", 'https://www.putrajaya.gov.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Putrajaya%20Malaysia', 'Putrajaya (Federal Territory)', '30 km', '35-50 min', 2.9305, 101.6956),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Genting Skyway', "🚡 Buckle up for the world's fastest cable car adventure! Genting Skyway whisks you through misty mountain forests at breathtaking speeds, revealing jaw-dropping views of endless green canopy below. As you ascend through the cool highland mist, watch the world transform from tropical jungle to mountain wonderland. It's not just transportation—it's a journey through the clouds, complete with audio guides narrating the magic unfolding outside your window.", 'https://www.rwgenting.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Genting%20Skyway%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '55 km', '1-1.5 hours', 3.7842, 103.3549),
    ('Places to Visit', 'National Zoo of Malaysia', "🦁 Where 500 species roam free and adventure awaits! Malaysia's National Zoo is a wild wonderland sprawling across 110 acres of tropical paradise. Trek through the Savannah, cross rope bridges over bears, and come face-to-face with Malaysian tigers. The after-dark Night Safari reveals a secret world of nocturnal creatures. Watch penguin parades, feed gentle giants, and let your inner wildlife explorer run wild. This isn't just a zoo—it's an expedition!", 'https://www.zoonegaramalaysia.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/National%20Zoo%20of%20Malaysia%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '15 km', '25-40 min', 3.0862, 101.5144),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Istana Negara', "👑 Witness royal splendor at Malaysia's former palace! Istana Negara opens its golden gates to reveal throne rooms dripping with majesty, royal regalia sparkling under chandeliers, and guards in ceremonial uniforms standing frozen like statues. Don't miss the daily Changing of the Guard—a theatrical display of precision and tradition. Walk the same halls where kings made history, and feel the weight of centuries of monarchy in every ornate detail.", 'https://www.istananegara.gov.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Istana%20Negara%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '5 km', '12-18 min', 3.1316, 101.6811),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Skyline Luge Kuala Lumpur', "🛷🎢 Race through the WORLD'S LONGEST LUGE TUNNEL at 52 metres! Skyline Luge offers 1.6km of pure adrenaline across 4 different tracks complete with LED tunnels, downhill slopes, and tight turns that'll have you screaming with joy. YOU control the speed! Cruise leisurely or race like a champion - either way, cameras along the track capture every epic moment. Perfect for families and thrill-seekers alike at Gamuda Cove! 🏆📷", 'https://www.skylineluge.com/kuala-lumpur', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Skyline%20Luge%20Kuala%20Lumpur%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-35 min', 3.0767, 101.5241),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Immersify KL', "🎨✨ Step into Malaysia's most mind-bending digital art experience! This 30,000sqft wonderland features 11 specially designed zones with 12-metre-tall projections that'll make you feel like you've stepped inside a dream. 3D surround sound wraps around you as you journey through visuals inspired by human emotions. Instagram-worthy? Beyond! Every zone is a new reality waiting to be explored. Located at The Labs City Centre, Bukit Bintang. 📸🌈", 'https://immersify.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Immersify%20KL%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '2 km', '8-12 min', 3.1645, 101.6764),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Skytrex Adventure, Shah Alam', "🌿 Ready to unleash your inner Tarzan? Skytrex Adventure transforms you into a jungle explorer, soaring through ancient treetops on heart-racing ziplines over shimmering lakes! Balance on suspended logs, conquer 15 pulse-pounding challenges, and feel the adrenaline surge as you navigate the forest canopy like never before. From gentle family fun to extreme obstacles for thrill-seekers, this Shah Alam adventure guarantees screams, laughs, and unforgettable memories in nature's ultimate playground.", 'https://www.skytrex-adventure.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Skytrex%20Adventure%2C%20Shah%20Alam%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '30 km', '35-50 min', 3.073, 101.5008),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Urban Museum (UR-MU)', "🎭🖼️ Discover KL's hidden art secret across THREE stunning museum locations! Founded by acclaimed architect Mr Tan Loke Mun, these contemporary art spaces house over 200 exhibits each from Malaysia's most prominent collectors. Beyond static viewing, join drawing workshops, seminars, and live performances. Art comes ALIVE here! Tickets from just RM20. Locations: Bukit Bintang, Raja Chulan & Jalan Tun H S Lee. 🎨✨", 'https://www.urmu.art', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Urban%20Museum%20(UR-MU)%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '10-15 min', 3.1391, 101.7002),
    ('Places to Visit', 'The Bomb Battle', "💣🎮 Can you defuse the bomb before it EXPLODES?! This isn't your ordinary escape room - dodge lasers, crack codes, and race against a ticking paint bomb! Fail, and you're drenched head-to-toe in neon paint! 😱 Don't worry, hazmat suits keep your outfit safe. 75 minutes of mental and physical challenges await at Berjaya Times Square. Also try The Greatest Lava (Floor Is Lava with 500+ tiles!) or Versus Arena team battles! 🔥", 'https://bombbattle.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/The%20Bomb%20Battle%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '10-15 min', 3.1212, 101.6788),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Townsquare Park Gamuda Cove', "🌸🇫🇷 Think you're in PARIS? Think again! This European-inspired park features tree-lined avenues and majestic fountains straight out of the Tuileries Gardens. Frolic through flower fields, pose by grand water fountains, or hop on FREE trams shuttling visitors around Gamuda Cove. Malaysia meets Europe in this stunning outdoor escape. Perfect for romantic strolls, family picnics, and those Parisian-vibes photos! 📸💕", 'https://gamudacove.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Townsquare%20Park%20Gamuda%20Cove%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '45 km', '45-60 min', 3.0492, 101.5401),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Billion Onsen & Aesthetics', "♨️🌙 24-HOUR spa heaven in the heart of KL! Whether it's 3am or 3pm, relaxation awaits. Indulge in refreshing facials, blissful massages, or sweat out toxins in their authentic onsens and saunas. Located at Jalan Yap Kwan Seng, this luxury spa offers complete amenities including showers to freshen up post-treatment. Your wellness journey has no closing time here! 🧖\u200d♀️✨", 'https://www.billiononsen.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Billion%20Onsen%20%26%20Aesthetics%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '1 km', '5-8 min', 3.1139, 101.6889),
    ('Places to Visit', "Beryl's Chocolate Museum", "🍫🏭 FREE ENTRY to chocolate paradise! Tour the fascinating history of chocolate and cacao, marvel at antique chocolate-making machines, and learn how Malaysia's favourite Beryl's chocolates are created. The 45-minute journey ends at their store where you can stock up on gifts for loved ones. Located in Seri Kembangan - the sweetest detour on any KL trip! 🎁😋", 'https://www.beryls.com.my', "https://www.google.com/maps/search/Beryl's%20Chocolate%20Museum%20Malaysia", 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-35 min', 3.061, 101.5274),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Wisma Kebudayaan', "🎨🌺 FREE art immersion! This museum features seasonally changing exhibitions celebrating Malaysian art and culture. Past exhibitions like 'Blossom of Hope' showcased paintings, floral art, and interactive installations where YOU become part of the artwork. Check Harmoni Soka website for upcoming exhibitions and return again and again - every visit is a brand new experience! 🌸✨", 'https://www.harmonisoka.org.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Wisma%20Kebudayaan%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '5 km', '12-18 min', 3.1149, 101.6797),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Maybank Numismatic Museum', "💰 Money grows on trees here—literally! The Maybank Numismatic Museum houses Southeast Asia's largest currency collection beneath a towering sculpture of a 'money tree.' Hold ancient coins that once traded in legendary markets, see banknotes from empires long gone, and discover how shells and beads once bought kingdoms. This hidden gem inside the iconic Maybank Tower tells the fascinating story of how value evolved from barter to bitcoin. Free entry—priceless memories!", 'https://www.maybank.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Maybank%20Numismatic%20Museum%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '10-12 min', 3.1532, 101.6804),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Merdeka Square (Dataran Merdeka)', "🇲🇾🏛️ Where Malaysia's independence was declared! This historic square features the iconic Merdeka flag pole (one of world's tallest), stunning Sultan Abdul Samad Building with Moorish architecture, and beautiful fountains. FREE entry and perfect for evening photos. A must-visit for history lovers! 🎉📸", 'https://www.kuala-lumpur.ws/attractions/merdeka-square.htm', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Merdeka%20Square%20Kuala%20Lumpur%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '2 km', '10-15 min', 3.1323, 101.6793),
    ('Places to Visit', 'KL Forest Eco Park (Bukit Nanas)', '🌿🌳 Rainforest in the HEART of KL! This 9-hectare preserved forest offers canopy walkways, hiking trails, and wildlife spotting - all surrounded by skyscrapers! See monitor lizards, monkeys, and beautiful butterflies. FREE entry and perfect escape from city heat! 🦎🦋', 'https://www.forestry.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/KL%20Forest%20Eco%20Park%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '1 km', '5-10 min', 3.1596, 101.6644),
    ('Places to Visit', 'National Monument (Tugu Negara)', '🏛️🇲🇾 Powerful tribute to Malaysian heroes! This bronze sculpture commemorates those who died fighting for independence. Set in beautiful Lake Gardens (Perdana Botanical Garden) with reflecting pools and landscaped grounds. Peaceful and moving. FREE entry! 🌿💐', 'https://www.kuala-lumpur.ws/attractions/national-monument.htm', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/National%20Monument%20Tugu%20Negara%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '15-20 min', 3.1676, 101.6974),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Perdana Botanical Garden (Lake Gardens)', "🌸🌺 KL's green lung! 92 hectares of beautifully landscaped gardens, lakes, and themed gardens including Orchid Garden, Hibiscus Garden, and Bird Park. Perfect for morning jogs, picnics, and family outings. Peaceful escape with fresh air! FREE entry to most areas! 🦋🌳", 'https://www.klbotanicalgarden.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Perdana%20Botanical%20Garden%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '15-20 min', 3.1339, 101.6642),
    ('Places to Visit', 'National Museum (Muzium Negara)', "🏛️📜 Journey through Malaysian history! From prehistoric times to independence, explore Malaysia's rich heritage through artifacts, dioramas, and interactive displays. Air-conditioned respite with educational value. Great for understanding Malaysia's multicultural story! 🎭🗿", 'https://www.muziumnegara.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/National%20Museum%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '15 min', 3.1648, 101.672),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Saloma Link Bridge', "🌉✨ KL's newest Instagram icon! This stunning illuminated pedestrian bridge connects Kampung Baru to KLCC with spectacular night lighting. Best visited after sunset when colors dance. FREE access and perfect photo opportunity with Twin Towers! 📸🌙", 'https://www.kuala-lumpur.ws', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Saloma%20Link%20Bridge%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0.5 km', '5 min', 3.1626, 101.66),
    ('Places to Visit', 'River of Life (Masjid Jamek)', "🌊💙 Transformed river precinct! The historic confluence of Klang and Gombak rivers now features beautiful blue lighting, water features, and walking promenades. Visit stunning Masjid Jamek mosque (1909) - KL's oldest. Beautiful at sunset and night! FREE! 🕌✨", 'https://www.dbkl.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/River%20of%20Life%20Masjid%20Jamek%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '2 km', '10-15 min', 3.1568, 101.7127),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Pavilion KL', '🛍️ Welcome to retail heaven in the heart of Bukit Bintang! Pavilion KL dazzles with 1.37 million sq ft of pure shopping bliss—over 550 outlets ranging from haute couture to hidden gems. Sip champagne at rooftop restaurants, catch the latest blockbusters, and lose yourself in seven floors of fashion, food, and fun. The dazzling Christmas displays and Chinese New Year decorations are legendary. This is where KL comes to see and be seen!', 'https://www.pavilion-kl.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pavilion%20KL%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '1.5 km', '8-12 min', 3.1337, 101.6781),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Berjaya Times Square', "🎢 Shop, eat, and scream! Berjaya Times Square isn't just a mall—it's a 48-storey adventure with an indoor theme park that'll flip your world upside down! With over 1,000 stores, 65 restaurants, and heart-stopping roller coasters under one roof, this is where retail therapy meets adrenaline rush. Connected to a luxury hotel with pools and rooftop gardens, you might never want to leave. The fifth-largest building in the world is also five times the fun!", 'https://www.berjayatimessquarekl.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Berjaya%20Times%20Square%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '2 km', '10-15 min', 3.1591, 101.6571),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Sephora KL', "💄 Beauty obsessives, your temple awaits! Sephora KL is a 10,000 sq ft playground of every cosmetic dream—from cult favorites to exclusive launches you can't find anywhere else. Their legendary lifetime return policy means zero regrets! Test, play, and transform at endless makeup stations, discover skincare miracles, and let beauty advisors unlock your best look. This two-storey wonderland is pure magic for anyone who believes beauty should be an adventure.", 'https://www.sephora.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sephora%20KL%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '1.5 km', '8-12 min', 3.1471, 101.7065),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Lot 10', "🎸 Vintage vibes meet cutting-edge cool! Lot 10 is where KL's fashionistas come to hunt for one-of-a-kind pieces in boutiques you won't find anywhere else. This iconic mint-green building has ruled Bintang Walk since forever, with a secret sky bridge connecting you to shopping adventures beyond. The basement food court is legendary among locals—authentic Malaysian hawker food in air-conditioned comfort. Old soul, new style—that's Lot 10!", 'https://www.lot10.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lot%2010%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '1 km', '5-10 min', 3.1158, 101.6854),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Starhill Gallery', "✨ Roll out the red carpet—Starhill Gallery is luxury redefined! Smartly dressed doormen, jazz floating through the air, and plush carpets cushioning every step create a shopping experience fit for royalty. Over 100 of the world's most prestigious labels call this 250,000 sq ft paradise home. This isn't shopping—it's an event. Dress to impress, because at Starhill, you're not just a customer—you're a VIP!", 'https://www.starhillgallery.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Starhill%20Gallery%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '1.2 km', '8-12 min', 3.1114, 101.7129),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Fahrenheit 8', "🌡️ Hot fashion for KL's hottest district! Fahrenheit 88 earned its name because Malaysia rarely dips below 88°F—and this five-storey fashion hub keeps things equally heated! After a RM100 million glow-up, this Bukit Bintang icon delivers trendy fashion, buzzing cafes, and prime people-watching. Young, vibrant, and always buzzing—it's where KL's style-savvy youth come to strut their stuff and snap their next profile pic!", 'https://www.fahrenheit88.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/%20Fahrenheit%208%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '1 km', '5-10 min', 3.121, 101.6703),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Kenanga Wholesale City', "💸 Fashionistas, empty your bags—wholesale prices await! Kenanga Wholesale City is KL's worst-kept secret: 800 stores of fashion, accessories, and shoes at prices that'll make you dizzy! New collections drop weekly as merchandise flies off shelves. Come early, stay late, and leave with arms full of treasures at a fraction of retail. Inspired by Asia's legendary wholesale markets, this is smart shopping at its finest. Your wardrobe (and wallet) will thank you!", 'https://www.kenangawholesalecity.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kenanga%20Wholesale%20City%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '10-15 min', 3.1577, 101.6851),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Avenue K Shopping Mall', "🌆 Shop with the Twin Towers as your backdrop! Avenue K puts you right next to KLCC with a direct bridge to the LRT station. Six floors of lifestyle finds await—from trendy boutiques to cozy cafes perfect for watching the city's heartbeat. The vibe is friendly but exclusive, like a secret only cool kids know about. Grab a coffee, browse at your leisure, and feel the pulse of Malaysia's most iconic address.", 'https://www.avenuek.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Avenue%20K%20Shopping%20Mall%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0.3 km', '3-5 min', 3.1478, 101.6576),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Nu Sentral Mall', "🚄 All roads lead to Nu Sentral! Connected to Malaysia's biggest transport hub, this eight-storey shopping paradise is where convenience meets cool. Alfresco dining terraces, entertainment zones, and endless retail therapy—all steps from trains to anywhere in Malaysia. Early morning flight? Shop till the last minute, then roll your bags straight to the airport terminal. For travelers and locals alike, Nu Sentral makes life effortlessly stylish.", 'https://www.nusentral.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/%20Nu%20Sentral%20Mall%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '5 km', '12-18 min', 3.1551, 101.688),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Mid Valley Megamall', "🏆 Welcome to one of Southeast Asia's retail giants! Mid Valley Megamall is legendary—five floors, 430 stores, and everything from high street to haute couture. Weekends bring families, fashionistas, and foodies together in a retail celebration that's been going strong since 1999. Golden Screen Cinemas, anchor stores galore, and food courts serving every cuisine under the sun. This isn't just a mall—it's where KL comes together!", 'https://www.midvalley.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mid%20Valley%20Megamall%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '8 km', '15-25 min', 3.1372, 101.7131),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Utama Shopping Centre', "🌏 Prepare to get lost—wonderfully lost! 1 Utama is the world's fourth largest mall, spanning a mind-blowing 5 million sq ft across two wings. International and local brands jostle for attention, rooftop gardens offer urban escapes, and the Secret Garden hosts living sculptures and exotic plants. Old Wing, New Wing—both lead to discoveries. Budget an entire day, wear comfortable shoes, and let the adventure begin!", 'https://www.1utama.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Utama%20Shopping%20Centre%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '30-45 min', 3.0904, 101.5041),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'The Curve', "🎪 Weekend warriors, this is your calling! The Curve brings indoor and outdoor shopping together in Mutiara Damansara's coolest hangout. The Saturday-Sunday flea market along The Street is legendary—vintage finds, handmade treasures, and busking talents all in one open-air celebration. Over 200 shops provide retail backup, while cafes spill onto walkways for perfect people-watching. Bring your curiosity and an empty tote bag!", 'https://www.thecurve.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/The%20Curve%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '30-45 min', 3.0699, 101.5283),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Sunway Pyramid', "🔮 Enter the realm of the Pharaohs—with air conditioning! Sunway Pyramid channels ancient Egypt right here in Bandar Sunway, complete with a massive sphinx guarding the entrance and faux hieroglyphics decorating every corner. Ice skate under pyramid ceilings, shop 1.7 million sq ft of retail adventure, and feel the mystical vibes of Malaysia's most uniquely themed mall. It's shopping like you've never experienced—wrapped in mysteries of the Nile!", 'https://www.sunwaypyramid.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sunway%20Pyramid%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-40 min', 3.0598, 101.5147),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Paradigm Mall', "🎬 Your neighborhood just got glamorous! Paradigm Mall brings cinema magic, fitness goals, and 100+ fashion finds to your doorstep. Games arcades keep the kids busy while 50+ restaurants feed every craving. Mid-market international brands mix with local boutiques in a friendly, accessible atmosphere. It's not trying to be flashy—it's just effortlessly cool and perfectly practical for everyday adventures.", 'https://www.paradigmmall.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Paradigm%20Mall%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '15 km', '20-35 min', 3.0925, 101.5189),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'SS Two Mall', "💎 Discover Petaling Jaya's rising star! SSTWO Mall serves the SS2 and SS17 neighborhoods with 200+ shops, from fashion finds to fitness centers and spa treatments. Urban Food anchors the lower level with fresh groceries, while boutiques above offer the latest trends. It's not crowded, not pretentious—just genuinely great shopping for smart locals who appreciate quality without the chaos. A hidden gem waiting to be found!", 'https://www.sstwomall.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/%20SS%20Two%20Mall%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '12 km', '20-30 min', 3.0984, 101.5483),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Empire Shopping Gallery', '🌿 Elegance blooms in Subang Jaya! Empire Shopping Gallery is sophisticated simplicity—180 stores wrapped in beautiful architecture and outdoor landscaping that feels like a resort. Clean sightlines let you see from end to end, making navigation a breeze. The vibe is upscale but welcoming, with premium brands and thoughtful design everywhere you look. This is where style meets serenity in perfect balance.', 'https://www.empireshoppinggallery.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Empire%20Shopping%20Gallery%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '15 km', '20-30 min', 3.0534, 101.4932),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'One City', "☁️ Three worlds, one spectacular address! One City soars with Sky Park's rooftop restaurants 10 floors up, where glass floors reveal dizzying drops and city views stretch forever. The Place buzzes with retail energy below, while The Garden Shoppe wraps shopping in living greenery and bazaar charm. Natural light floods through the 12-foot atrium, making every visit feel like a sunshine celebration. Unique, unforgettable, utterly One City!", 'https://www.onecity.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/One%20City%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '20 km', '30-45 min', 3.0539, 101.5243),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'IOI City Mall Putrajaya', "🌟 Putrajaya's megamall dreams big! IOI City Mall packs 350 outlets into 130,000 square metres of sleek, modern retail paradise. From Sephora to Nike, local gems to international icons—plus entertainment zones and restaurants galore. The architecture soars with natural light while the shopping possibilities seem endless. Connected to the administrative capital's growing urban scene, this is where Putrajaya comes to play!", 'https://www.ioicitymall.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/IOI%20City%20Mall%20Putrajaya%20Malaysia', 'Putrajaya', '28 km', '35-50 min', 2.9211, 101.7229),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'IOI Mall Puchong', "🎉 Puchong's favorite playground keeps getting better! IOI Mall has served this vibrant community since forever, growing alongside the neighborhood into a beloved destination. Anchor stores, familiar brands, and countless dining options make every visit productive and fun. It's not the newest or flashiest—it's better: a reliable friend that always has what you need, right in your backyard.", 'https://www.ioimall.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/IOI%20Mall%20Puchong%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '22 km', '30-45 min', 3.0478, 101.5128),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Sunway Velocity, Cheras', "⚡ Speed into the future at Sunway Velocity! This Cheras powerhouse pulses with energy—innovative retail concepts, exciting F&B discoveries, and entertainment that keeps the whole family busy. The name says it all: fast, dynamic, and always moving forward. Located at the intersection of KL's growing east side, this is where modern living meets maximum convenience. Buckle up!", 'https://www.sunwayvelocity.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sunway%20Velocity%2C%20Cheras%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '10-15 min', 3.1459, 101.7157),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'MyTOWN Shopping Centre, Cheras', '🏙️ Cheras just got cooler! MyTOWN Shopping Centre redefines suburban retail with IKEA as its anchor and endless discoveries waiting around every corner. Natural design elements soften the urban edge while lifestyle brands create a curated shopping experience. Food halls buzz with flavor, entertainment options abound, and the whole family finds something to love. Your town, your mall, your MyTOWN!', 'https://www.mytown.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/MyTOWN%20Shopping%20Centre%2C%20Cheras%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '5 km', '10-18 min', 3.1676, 101.6658),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Evolve Concept Mall, Ara Damansara', "🌅 Ara Damansara's lifestyle evolution! Evolve Concept Mall lives up to its name—constantly reinventing itself with fresh concepts, hip cafes, and community-focused retail. The architecture breathes with open spaces and natural light, creating a relaxed shopping atmosphere. Less frantic than the mega-malls, more exciting than the usual—Evolve hits that sweet spot where shopping feels like leisure.", 'https://www.evolveconceptmall.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Evolve%20Concept%20Mall%2C%20Ara%20Damansara%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-40 min', 3.0626, 101.4954),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'The Starling, Damansara Uptown', '⭐ Look up—The Starling has landed in Damansara Uptown! This striking architectural statement houses curated retail and dining experiences designed for discerning shoppers. The crowd is young, professional, and appreciates quality over quantity. Rooftop dining delivers sunset views while ground-floor boutiques serve up the latest trends. Modern, minimal, and magnificently stylish—Damansara Uptown finally has its star!', 'https://www.thestarling.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/The%20Starling%2C%20Damansara%20Uptown%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '12 km', '20-30 min', 3.0523, 101.5154),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Glo Damansara', '✨ Good vibes glow at Glo Damansara! Intimate and inviting, this boutique mall offers a more personal shopping experience away from mega-mall madness. Local boutiques, cozy cafes, and specialty stores create a neighborhood feel with cosmopolitan flair. The name promises brightness, and the experience delivers. Sometimes smaller is better—and Glo proves it beautifully.', 'https://www.glodamansara.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Glo%20Damansara%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '10 km', '18-25 min', 3.1175, 101.6597),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'KL Gateway Mall, Bangsar South', "🚀 Bangsar South's gateway to everything! KL Gateway Mall connects shoppers to the MRT while serving up retail, dining, and entertainment for the bustling professional district. The crowd is young and upwardly mobile, the shops cater to modern lifestyles, and the location couldn't be more convenient. Work, live, shop, repeat—all within walking distance.", 'https://www.klgatewaymall.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/KL%20Gateway%20Mall%2C%20Bangsar%20South%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '6 km', '12-20 min', 3.1306, 101.711),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Star Avenue, Jalan Sungai Buloh', '🌟 Star Avenue lights up Sungai Buloh! This community mall brings suburban convenience with metropolitan style to a growing neighborhood. Familiar retail names mix with local favorites, creating a one-stop destination for daily needs and weekend treats. Easy parking, friendly atmosphere, and everything in reach—suburban shopping done right!', 'https://www.staravenue.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Star%20Avenue%2C%20Jalan%20Sungai%20Buloh%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '22 km', '30-45 min', 3.0589, 101.5448),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Selayang City Mall, Selayang', "🏡 Selayang's pride and joy! Selayang City Mall serves the community with dedication—groceries, fashion, entertainment, and dining all under one roof. It's where neighbors bump into neighbors, where weekly routines include mall walks, and where community spirit thrives in air-conditioned comfort. Not glamorous, just genuinely great for the people it serves.", 'https://www.selayangcitymall.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Selayang%20City%20Mall%2C%20Selayang%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '15 km', '25-40 min', 3.0765, 101.5297),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Pavillion 2, Bukit Jalil City', "🎊 Bukit Jalil's spectacular newcomer! Pavilion 2 brings the legendary Pavilion brand to the south with jaw-dropping architecture and retail excellence. Massive floor plates house both international luxury and accessible favorites. The stadium and surrounding developments add excitement to every visit. A new landmark rises—and it's already drawing crowds from across the city!", 'https://www.pavilion-bukitjalil.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pavillion%202%2C%20Bukit%20Jalil%20City%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '15 km', '25-35 min', 3.1481, 101.6915),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Damen, USJ', "🎭 USJ's urban playground gets artsy! Damen isn't just a mall—it's a cultural destination with independent boutiques, artisan cafes, and creative spaces mixed with mainstream retail. The crowd appreciates individuality, the vibe leans bohemian-cool, and discoveries wait around every corner. Express yourself at Damen—where shopping gets an artistic edge.", 'https://www.damenusj.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Damen%2C%20USJ%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '20 km', '30-45 min', 3.044, 101.5354),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Suria KLCC', "💎 The crown jewel of Malaysian retail! Suria KLCC sits at the feet of the majestic Petronas Twin Towers, offering world-class shopping with the world's most iconic backdrop. International luxury brands sparkle alongside local treasures, while the Aquaria KLCC, concert hall, and art gallery add cultural depth. This isn't just shopping—it's an experience that defines Kuala Lumpur!", 'https://www.suriaklcc.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Suria%20KLCC%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0 km', 'At KLCC', 3.1412, 101.7091),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'IOI City Mall, Putrajaya', "🏆 Putrajaya's premier destination keeps expanding! IOI City Mall 2 doubles down on retail excellence with even more outlets, dining options, and entertainment choices. The sleek design and generous spaces make shopping a pleasure rather than a chore. As Putrajaya grows, this mall grows with it—setting the standard for suburban retail.", 'https://www.ioicitymall.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/IOI%20City%20Mall%2C%20Putrajaya%20Malaysia', 'Putrajaya', '28 km', '35-50 min', 2.9004, 101.668),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'The Gardens Mall Kuala Lumpur', "🌺 Where elegance meets excellence! The Gardens Mall brings sophisticated shopping to Mid Valley's doorstep with a carefully curated selection of premium brands. The ambiance is serene, the design is lush with botanical touches, and the crowd appreciates quality over chaos. Connected yet distinct from its Megamall neighbor, this is refined retail therapy at its finest.", 'https://www.thegardensmall.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/The%20Gardens%20Mall%20Kuala%20Lumpur%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '8 km', '15-25 min', 3.1582, 101.6611),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Mitsui Outlet Park Klia Sepang', "🛒 Outlet shopping takes flight near KLIA! Mitsui Outlet Park brings Japanese precision to bargain hunting—premium brands at factory-direct prices, all 6km from the airport. The Japan Avenue transports you to Tokyo with authentic cuisine, culture, and collectibles. Perfect for pre-flight splurges or dedicated outlet expeditions. Land deals that'll have you adding an extra suitcase!", 'https://www.mitsuioutletparkklia.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mitsui%20Outlet%20Park%20Klia%20Sepang%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '55 km', '50-70 min', 3.0725, 101.5434),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'The Exchange TRX', "🌆 The future of retail has arrived! The Exchange TRX transforms Malaysia's new financial district into a lifestyle paradise. Over 400 experiential stores—many exclusive to Malaysia—wrap around innovative entertainment concepts you've never seen before. This isn't just shopping; it's the next evolution. Welcome to where Kuala Lumpur meets tomorrow!", 'https://www.theexchangetrx.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/The%20Exchange%20TRX%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '2 km', '8-12 min', 3.1483, 101.6633),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Ombak Mall', "🌊✨ Rising like a WAVE next to the iconic Petronas Twin Towers! This stunning 6-storey architectural marvel features 420,000sqft of retail paradise with 120 outlets. Discover a rooftop park, vibrant marketplace, and Galeri Petronas offering immersive experiences. Connected directly to MRT Putrajaya Line with covered walkways to Suria KLCC. Opening October 2025 - KL's newest landmark awaits! 🏬🌟", 'https://www.klcc.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ombak%20Mall%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '30 km', '40-55 min', 3.06, 101.5354),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Hextar World at Empire City', "🎢🌍 The WAIT IS OVER! After 14 years, Empire City Damansara's mega mall is here with 600+ outlets across 23 acres! Stroll European and American-inspired streets, feast at NomNom Food Hall and Japanese hub Senkyaku Banrai. But wait - there's MORE! Olympic-sized ice skating at MYNISS, Malaysia's LARGEST indoor water park & ski training at Slope Master, plus 9,000 parking spots! Entertainment paradise! 🎿⛸️", 'https://hextarworld.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hextar%20World%20at%20Empire%20City%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '20 km', '30-45 min', 3.0572, 101.5205),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'KLGCC Mall', "👨\u200d👩\u200d👧\u200d👦🏌️ Family-focused retail haven in prestigious Bukit Kiara! Part of the iconic KL Golf & Country Club Resort, this Q3 2025 opening brings 80+ retailers including Jaya Grocer, ACE Hardware, and Serai Group's flagship store. EXCLUSIVE: Malaysia's FIRST HarborLand indoor playground from Thailand! Asia Ballet Academy for aspiring dancers. Where luxury meets family fun! 🛍️✨", 'https://www.simedarbyproperty.com/klgcc', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/KLGCC%20Mall%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '12 km', '20-30 min', 3.1245, 101.679),
    ('Shopping Malls', 'Sunway Square Mall', "📚🎭 Where entertainment meets enlightenment in Sunway City! Four floors, 150+ shops, PLUS Malaysia's first 24-HOUR BOOKXCESS library concept! TGV Cinemas, Village Grocer, BUMP Bouldering, and KKV lifestyle brand. Next door: 1,200-seater performing arts centre! TUTU TOE Dance Academy welcomes aspiring ballerinas. September 2025 opening - where culture meets commerce! 🎬📖", 'https://www.sunwaymalls.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sunway%20Square%20Mall%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-40 min', 3.06, 101.5215),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Genting Highlands Theme Park', "🎢 Touch the clouds at Malaysia's legendary highland escape! Genting Highlands Theme Park sits 2,000 metres above sea level where cool mountain air meets heart-pounding thrills. Four zones of adventure await—from gentle family rides to scream-inducing roller coasters that defy gravity! Just 50km from KL, this hilltop wonderland trades tropical heat for misty mountain magic. Whether you're chasing adrenaline or just the cooler weather, Genting delivers entertainment that soars above the rest—literally!", 'https://www.rwgenting.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Genting%20Highlands%20Theme%20Park%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '55 km', '1-1.5 hours', 3.8311, 103.3156),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Melaka Wonderland Theme Park, Malacca', "✨ Malacca's magical water wonderland! Melaka Wonderland Theme Park delivers splash after splash of family fun—from gentle kiddie pools to extreme water slides that'll make your heart race. Night brings special light shows transforming the park into a glowing fantasy. Located conveniently near the historic city, this water paradise offers the perfect cool-down after exploring Malacca's heritage sites. History by day, splash by night!", 'https://www.melakawonderland.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Melaka%20Wonderland%20Theme%20Park%2C%20Malacca%20Malaysia', 'Melaka', '150 km', '2-2.5 hours', 2.1721, 102.2373),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', "A' Famosa Water Theme Park, Malacca", "💦 Splash into Malacca's aquatic wonderland! A'Famosa Water Theme Park transforms scorching days into cool adventures with over 20 attractions for every age. Brave the gut-dropping slides, float peacefully down lazy rivers, or watch the kids splash wild in dedicated play zones. Part of the legendary A'Famosa Resort complex, this water world offers escape from the historic city's heat into pure refreshing fun. History and water parks? Only in Malacca!", 'https://www.afamosa.com/', "https://www.google.com/maps/search/A'%20Famosa%20Water%20Theme%20Park%2C%20Malacca%20Malaysia", 'Melaka', '120 km', '1.5-2 hours', 2.1791, 102.2439),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Bukit Merah Laketown Theme Park, Ipoh', "🌊 Ride the giant waves without leaving Ipoh! Bukit Merah Laketown Waterpark unleashes splashing madness—metre-high waves crashing in the Giant Wave Pool, lazy river tubes drifting past tropical scenery, and heart-stopping raft slides plunging into refreshing pools. Kids go wild in the obstacle-course water playground with giant bucket dumps and water-jet battles! Don't miss the Giant Bubble—Southeast Asia's first inflatable Swedish wonder where you climb, bounce, slip, and slide. Sun, splash, and endless summer await!", 'https://www.bukitmerahlaketown.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bukit%20Merah%20Laketown%20Theme%20Park%2C%20Ipoh%20Malaysia', 'Perak', '240 km', '3-3.5 hours', 4.5986, 101.1187),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Lost World of Tambun Theme Park, Ipoh', "🦖 Step into a prehistoric paradise! Lost World of Tambun in Ipoh transports you through time—splash in natural hot springs, scream through water slides, and walk among life-sized dinosaurs! This 40-acre wonderland combines nature, adventure, and fantasy in one unforgettable destination. Night brings the Luminous Forest to life with magical light displays. From petting zoos to wave pools to tiger valleys—every day is a new expedition. The lost world has been found—and it's spectacular!", 'https://www.sunwaycity.com.my/lostworldoftambun/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/%20Lost%20World%20of%20Tambun%20Theme%20Park%2C%20Ipoh%20Malaysia', 'Perak', '200 km', '2.5-3 hours', 4.5887, 101.1017),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Bukit Gambang Resort City, Kuantan', "🏝️ Where adventure has no boundaries! Bukit Gambang Resort City sprawls across 547 acres of pure excitement—Kuantan's ultimate playground for thrill-seekers and relaxation-seekers alike. Splash through the water park, zoom around the go-kart track, bond with wildlife at the safari park, and sleep in themed accommodations that transport you to different worlds. It's not just a day trip—it's a vacation destination. East Coast Malaysia's biggest resort city delivers big dreams and bigger thrills!", 'https://www.bukitgambangresort.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/%20Bukit%20Gambang%20Resort%20City%2C%20Kuantan%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '280 km', '3-3.5 hours', 3.8377, 103.3556),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Escape Adventureplay, Teluk Bahang', "🌿 Unleash your inner adventurer! ESCAPE Teluk Bahang challenges you to conquer Penang's jungle canopy on world-class zip lines and treetop obstacles. This isn't a theme park—it's a real outdoor adventure where you test your limits against nature's obstacles. Soar across valleys, climb to dizzying heights, and feel the rush of Malaysia's premier adventure playground. Combined with the attached water park, this is where ordinary days become extraordinary stories!", 'https://www.escape.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Escape%20Adventureplay%2C%20Teluk%20Bahang%20Malaysia', 'Penang', '350 km', '4-5 hours', 5.4352, 100.3539),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Legoland Malaysia, Johor Bahru', "🧱 Where imagination builds reality! LEGOLAND Malaysia brings billions of colorful bricks to life across seven themed zones—from underwater adventures to Star Wars galaxies! Watch Asia's landmarks rebuilt in miniature, plunge down water coaster splashdowns, and build your own creations in hands-on workshops. The only LEGOLAND in Asia outside Japan, this JB wonderland proves everything is awesome when you're building dreams together. Warning: adults get hooked too!", 'https://www.legoland.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/%20Legoland%20Malaysia%2C%20Johor%20Bahru%20Malaysia', 'Johor', '330 km', '3.5-4 hours', 1.4968, 103.7618),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'The Little Big Club, Johor Bharu', "🎪 JB brings beloved characters to life! The Little Big Club unites iconic kids' favorites—Thomas the Tank Engine, Barney, Bob the Builder, and friends—in one magical destination. Watch live shows, meet characters in person, and let little ones explore themed play areas designed just for them. Interactive, engaging, and endlessly delightful, this family entertainment center makes childhood dreams touchable. All aboard for imagination station!", 'https://www.thelittlebigclub.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/The%20Little%20Big%20Club%2C%20Johor%20Bharu%20Malaysia', 'Johor', '330 km', '3.5-4 hours', 1.4996, 103.713),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Sanrio Hello Kitty Town, Johor Bahru', "🎀 Welcome to the cutest place on Earth! Sanrio Hello Kitty Town is Asia's first Hello Kitty theme park—a pastel paradise where everyone's favorite feline and friends come to life! Ride the adorable attractions, dine on character-themed treats, and shop for exclusive merchandise you can't find anywhere else. From design workshops to magical shows, every corner sparkles with kawaii charm. Johor Bahru becomes the capital of cute!", 'https://www.sanriohellokittytown.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sanrio%20Hello%20Kitty%20Town%2C%20Johor%20Bahru%20Malaysia', 'Johor', '330 km', '3.5-4 hours', 1.4846, 103.7265),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Angry Birds Activity Park, Johor Bahru', "🐦 Slingshot into feathery fun! Angry Birds Activity Park launches families into gaming action brought to life. Climb, jump, and race through obstacle courses themed around the beloved birds and pigs. Perfect for kids who've conquered the game on screen and want to experience it in real life—with trampolines, play structures, and physical challenges that burn off endless energy. In JB, birds and pigs finally make peace through play!", 'https://www.angrybirdsactivitypark.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Angry%20Birds%20Activity%20Park%2C%20Johor%20Bahru%20Malaysia', 'Johor', '330 km', '3.5-4 hours', 1.5178, 103.7378),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', '"Dinosaurs Alive" Water Theme Park, Johor Bahru', "🦕 Jurassic adventures splash to life! Dinosaurs Alive Water Theme Park in JB combines prehistoric wonder with water park thrills. Encounter life-sized dinosaur animatronics around every slide and splash zone—roaring, moving, and delighting visitors of all ages. Cool off from Malaysia's heat while traveling back 65 million years. It's education meets entertainment meets total aquatic fun. Warning: dinosaurs may cause excessive excitement!", 'https://www.dinosaursalivewaterpark.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/%22Dinosaurs%20Alive%22%20Water%20Theme%20Park%2C%20Johor%20Bahru%20Malaysia', 'Johor', '330 km', '3.5-4 hours', 1.5211, 103.726),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Austin Heights Water & Adventure Park, Johor Bharu', "⚡ JB's ultimate splash-and-adventure combo! Austin Heights brings the best of both worlds—a thrilling water park with adrenaline-pumping slides AND an adventure park with climbing, obstacles, and challenges for every age. Beat Johor's heat in the wave pools, then dry off conquering sky-high rope courses. Perfect for families who want everything: water splashing, adventure scaling, and memories that last forever. South Malaysia just got a lot more exciting!", 'https://www.austinheights.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Austin%20Heights%20Water%20%26%20Adventure%20Park%2C%20Johor%20Bharu%20Malaysia', 'Johor', '330 km', '3.5-4 hours', 1.5062, 103.7683),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Movie Animation Park Studios(MAPS), Ipoh, Perak', "🎬 Lights, camera, splash! Movie Animation Park Studios (MAPS) in Ipoh brings animated dreams to life across 52 acres of cinematic adventure. From DreamWorks favorites to local heroes, beloved characters leap from screen to reality in shows, rides, and attractions. Malaysia's first animation theme park transforms Perak into Hollywood—Southeast Asian style! Walk through movie magic, pose with stars, and create blockbuster memories!", 'https://www.mapsperak.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Movie%20Animation%20Park%20Studios(MAPS)%2C%20Ipoh%2C%20Perak%20Malaysia', 'Perak', '180 km', '2-2.5 hours', 4.5943, 101.0709),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'A Famosa Water Theme Park, Malacca', "🌴 Double the splashing fun! A Famosa Water World (part of the greater A'Famosa Resort complex) offers refreshing escapes with wave pools, multi-lane racing slides, and endless aquatic adventures. Beyond the water, the resort offers golf, safari, and cowboy town experiences. A complete vacation destination that keeps families busy for days. Malacca's resort city proves one attraction is never enough!", 'https://www.afamosa.com/water-theme-park/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/A%20Famosa%20Water%20Theme%20Park%2C%20Malacca%20Malaysia', 'Melaka', '120 km', '1.5-2 hours', 2.1815, 102.2632),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Bayou Lagoon Water Park, Malacca', "🏖️ Lagoon vibes meet water park thrills! Bayou Lagoon Resort's in-house water park transforms Malacca stays into splash-filled adventures. Two elaborate water slides wind through resort grounds, sprawling pools host endless games, and a dedicated kids' zone keeps little ones safely splashing. Just 15 minutes from historic Malacca town, this resort-park combo offers the best of both worlds. Book a room, stay for the splashes!", 'https://www.bayoulagoon.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bayou%20Lagoon%20Water%20Park%2C%20Malacca%20Malaysia', 'Melaka', '150 km', '2-2.5 hours', 2.2031, 102.2295),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Escape Adventureplay, Penang', "🌳 The ultimate nature-meets-adventure playground! ESCAPE Penang (Adventureplay) challenges thrill-seekers across zip-lines, obstacles, and treetop adventures that'll test your courage and reward your spirit. Unlike artificial theme parks, this is real outdoor adventure among ancient trees and natural terrain. The attached water park adds splashing relief. Penang's answer to adventure tourism proves that sometimes, the best rides are the ones nature built. Conquer, climb, splash, repeat!", 'https://www.escape.my/penang/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Escape%20Adventureplay%2C%20Penang%20Malaysia', 'Penang', '350 km', '4-5 hours', 5.3914, 100.3543),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Slope Master Empire City', "🎿❄️ Malaysia's LARGEST indoor water park AND ski training facility! Experience the thrill of skiing and snowboarding in tropical Malaysia at this revolutionary venue inside Hextar World Empire City, Damansara. Perfect for beginners learning to shred powder or families seeking splash-tastic water adventures. Beat the heat with snow sports - only in Malaysia! Opening 2025. 🏂💦", 'https://hextarworld.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Slope%20Master%20Empire%20City%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '8 km', '15-25 min', 3.1631, 101.6785),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'MYNISS Olympic Ice Skating Stadium', '⛸️🏆 Olympic-sized DREAMS come true! Malaysia National Ice Skating Stadium (MYNISS) brings world-class ice skating to Hextar World Empire City. Glide across Olympic-standard ice, take skating lessons, or watch future champions practice. The rink meets international standards, putting Malaysia on the map for ice sports. Perfect family outing or romantic date! 🥇💕', 'https://hextarworld.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/MYNISS%20Olympic%20Ice%20Skating%20Stadium%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-40 min', 3.0647, 101.5078),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Desaru Coast Adventure Waterpark, Johor', "🌊🦈 The BIGGEST themed waterpark in Southeast Asia! Just 1.5 hours from Singapore, this 25-hectare paradise features a massive wave pool, heart-pounding slides, and the legendary Kraken's Revenge coaster. Sandy beaches, lazy rivers, and a dedicated kids' zone make this perfect for ALL ages. Part of the luxurious Desaru Coast development - beach resort meets water thrills! 🏖️🎢", 'https://www.desarucoast.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Desaru%20Coast%20Adventure%20Waterpark%2C%20Johor%20Malaysia', 'Johor', '350 km', '4-4.5 hours', 1.4916, 103.7382),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Adventure Park KOMTAR, Penang', "🌆🏗️ Thrills 249 METRES in the sky! Penang's iconic KOMTAR tower now hosts Malaysia's highest adventure park. Rainbow Skywalk around the building's edge, rope courses, and stunning panoramic views of George Town UNESCO Heritage Site below. Not for the faint-hearted, but the views and bragging rights are EPIC! Combined with The TOP Penang's other attractions. 🌈😱", 'https://thetop.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Adventure%20Park%20KOMTAR%2C%20Penang%20Malaysia', 'Penang', '340 km', '4-4.5 hours', 5.4137, 100.3586),
    ('Theme Parks (Outside KL)', 'Club Med Borneo, Sabah', "🏝️🌴 NEW 2026! Malaysia's newest premium all-inclusive resort paradise! Sprawled across 17 hectares of pristine white-sand beach in Kuala Penyu, Sabah, this Club Med brings world-famous resort lifestyle to Borneo. Rainforest meets ocean, adventure meets relaxation. Perfect for families seeking unforgettable tropical experiences with signature Club Med service. Opening 2026! ✨🌊", 'https://www.clubmed.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Club%20Med%20Borneo%2C%20Sabah%20Malaysia', 'Sabah', '1,600 km', 'Flight 2.5 hrs', 5.9702, 116.0621),
    ('For Children', 'Petrosains Discovery Centre', "🔬 Where science becomes the coolest adventure! Petrosains Discovery Centre transforms petroleum science into 7,000 sqm of mind-blowing interactive fun! Launch rockets, explore space stations, dig for fossils, and discover how oil powers our world—through hands-on exhibits that make learning irresistible. Hidden inside the iconic Petronas Twin Towers, this isn't a boring museum—it's 11 zones of pure discovery that'll have kids (and adults!) shouting 'WOW' around every corner. Science has never been this exciting!", 'https://www.petrosains.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Petrosains%20Discovery%20Centre%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0 km', 'At KLCC', 3.1542, 101.6607),
    ('For Children', 'Aquaria KLCC', '🐙 Dive into wonder without getting wet—much! Aquaria KLCC submerges families in 60,000 sq ft of aquatic amazement. Walk through a 90-metre underwater tunnel as sharks glide overhead and rays dance beside you. Touch starfish, feed stingrays, and come face-to-face with tiger sharks! Over 5,000 creatures from piranhas to sea dragons call this underground ocean home. The Land to Sea journey educates while it mesmerizes—perfect for curious young minds who dream of ocean exploration!', 'https://www.aquariaklcc.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Aquaria%20KLCC%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0.3 km', '5 min walk', 3.1106, 101.7084),
    ('For Children', 'Sunway Lagoon Theme Park, Petaling Jaya', "🎢 One ticket, endless adventures! Sunway Lagoon packs SIX theme parks into one epic destination—Africa's wildlife, Nickelodeon's cartoon heroes, terrifying scream parks, wet water worlds, extreme adventures, and the haunted Scream Park after dark! Splash, slide, swing, and scream through Malaysia's most diverse theme park experience. Just 30 minutes from KL, this PJ paradise keeps families busy for days. One visit is never enough—the kids will make sure of that!", 'https://www.sunwaylagoon.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sunway%20Lagoon%20Theme%20Park%2C%20Petaling%20Jaya%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-40 min', 3.0534, 101.4949),
    ('For Children', 'KidZania, Petaling Jaya', '👨\u200d🚒 Kids run the show at KidZania! This child-sized city lets little ones live their dream jobs—fight fires, perform surgery, broadcast news, or pilot planes. Over 60 role-playing activities teach responsibility through pure fun as kids earn (and spend!) their own KidZo currency. Parents watch proudly as their children discover passions they never knew existed. Located at The Curve, PJ—this is where future dreams begin today. Careers start young here!', 'https://www.kidzania.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/KidZania%2C%20Petaling%20Jaya%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-40 min', 3.0539, 101.4961),
    ('For Children', 'Kuala Lumpur National Zoo & Aquarium', "🦁 Wild wonders await at Malaysia's National Zoo! Nearly 500 species roam this 110-acre tropical sanctuary—from Malaysian tigers to Australian kangaroos. Trek through themed zones: Savannah Walk, Bear Complex, Children's World with its friendly farmyard! Don't miss the Night Safari when creatures of darkness emerge, or the daily penguin parades and elephant shows. Educational programs transform visits into learning adventures. Every child leaves as a junior wildlife conservationist!", 'https://www.zoonegaramalaysia.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kuala%20Lumpur%20National%20Zoo%20%26%20Aquarium%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '15 km', '25-40 min', 3.0753, 101.4897),
    ('For Children', 'Berjaya Times Square Theme Park, Bukit Bintang', "🎠 Indoor theme park INSIDE a shopping mall? Yes please! Berjaya Times Square Theme Park defies expectations with roller coasters zooming through retail space—the Supersonic Odyssey drops 14 stories, the DNA Mixer spins you dizzy, and the Spinning Orbit challenges gravity itself! Perfect for escaping KL's heat while getting your adrenaline fix. Shop, eat, and scream—all under one air-conditioned roof in Bukit Bintang. Retail therapy meets theme park therapy!", 'https://www.berjayatimessquarethemepark.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Berjaya%20Times%20Square%20Theme%20Park%2C%20Bukit%20Bintang%C2%A0%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '2 km', '10-15 min', 3.1201, 101.6677),
    ('For Children', 'i-City Theme Park, Shah Alam', "🌈 Where fantasy glows! i-City Shah Alam transforms into a rainbow wonderland after dark—millions of LED lights creating magical forests, giant insects, and photogenic installations that dazzle. By day, explore the House of Horror, wax museum, and water park. At night, the entire place explodes with color as light shows illuminate the sky. Malaysia's City of Digital Lights proves technology and imagination create pure magic together!", 'https://www.i-city.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/i-City%20Theme%20Park%2C%20Shah%20Alam%C2%A0%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '35 km', '40-55 min', 3.064, 101.4916),
    ('For Children', 'Farm in the City, Seri Kembangan', '🐰 Farm life comes to the city! Farm in the City Seri Kembangan brings over 100 species of adorable animals within petting distance—feed gentle deer, cuddle fluffy rabbits, marvel at colorful peacocks, and meet exotic creatures from around the world. Educational zones teach kids about different habitats while hands-on feeding sessions create unforgettable bonds with furry friends. No countryside trip needed—the farm adventure is right here!', 'https://www.farminthecity.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Farm%20in%20the%20City%2C%20Seri%20Kembangan%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-40 min', 3.0596, 101.4975),
    ('For Children', 'National Science Centre, Bukit Kiara', "🚀 Blast off to knowledge at the National Science Centre! Nestled in Bukit Kiara's greenery, this 7.5-hectare learning playground makes physics, chemistry, and biology genuinely thrilling. Over 700 interactive exhibits challenge young minds—build earthquake-proof structures, create musical vibrations, and explore space exploration! Planetarium shows project you among the stars. Free entry makes this knowledge-packed adventure accessible to all future scientists!", 'https://www.psn.gov.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/National%20Science%20Centre%2C%20Bukit%20Kiara%C2%A0%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '12 km', '20-30 min', 3.1311, 101.6774),
    ('For Children', 'Wet World Water Park Shah Alam', "💦 Shah Alam's splash zone of dreams! Wet World Water Park delivers refreshing escapes from Malaysian heat with wave pools that mimic ocean surf, slides that twist and plunge, and lazy rivers perfect for floating the afternoon away. Family-friendly attractions keep all ages splashing happily while the dedicated kiddie zone ensures even the smallest adventurers find their water wings. Cool, affordable, and endlessly fun!", 'https://www.wetworldwaterpark.com/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Wet%20World%20Water%20Park%20Shah%20Alam%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '28 km', '35-50 min', 3.0567, 101.5307),
    ('For Children', 'District 21 Kuala Lumpur', "🏃 Post-apocalyptic adventure indoors! District 21 transforms IOI City Mall into a 6,500 sqm obstacle course of steel beams, suspended ropes, and graffiti-covered challenges. This isn't a kids' playground—it's where teens and adults test limits on climbing walls, rope courses, and free-fall experiences! The industrial vibe creates an immersive adventure that gets hearts pounding. Lace up, buckle in, and conquer the concrete jungle!", 'https://www.district21.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/District%2021%20Kuala%20Lumpur%20Malaysia', 'Putrajaya', '28 km', '35-50 min', 2.9395, 101.7026),
    ('For Children', 'Megakidz Funland & Edutainment', '📚 Learning disguised as pure fun! Megakidz Funland & Edutainment spans 27,000 sqft of Mid Valley Megamall with activities for ages 1-16. Toddlers explore sensory wonderlands while big kids tackle science experiments and creative workshops. Every zone balances education with entertainment perfectly—slides lead to learning stations, ball pits inspire teamwork. Parents relax while kids develop minds and bodies. Affordable entry, priceless development. Playtime with purpose!', 'https://www.megakidz.com.my/', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Megakidz%20Funland%20%26%20Edutainment%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-40 min', 3.0654, 101.5231),
    ('For Children', 'HarborLand KLGCC Mall', "🎠✨ Thailand's FAMOUS HarborLand arrives in Malaysia! The country's FIRST branch at KLGCC Mall Bukit Kiara brings magical play paradise featuring sensory play areas, exciting role-play adventures, colourful slides, and massive ball pits. Designed for discovery, imagination, and endless exploration. Watch little ones light up with joy in this premium indoor playground! Ages 1-12. 🌈🧒", 'https://www.simedarbyproperty.com/klgcc', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/HarborLand%20KLGCC%20Mall%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '12 km', '20-30 min', 3.1125, 101.7113),
    ('For Children', 'Vroom Town Malaysia', "🚗🏙️ Singapore's iconic Kids' Drive-Play City is NOW in KL! Little drivers explore a complete mini city on wheels - post office, supermarket, car wash, drive-through cafe - all navigated in adorable mini vehicles! Kids get their own driver's license, learn road rules, and navigate traffic lights. At Atria Shopping Gallery, PJ. The COOLEST way to learn responsibility! 🚦👦", 'https://www.vroomtown.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Vroom%20Town%20Malaysia%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '15 km', '25-35 min', 3.1328, 101.6778),
    ('For Children', 'MoSAIC - Museum of Science, Arts and Innovation for Children', "🔬🎨 A 'living laboratory' in the heart of KL for young minds aged 4-17! Bridge science and imagination through interactive exhibits, sensory play, and discovery activities. Not just a museum - it's where curiosity comes ALIVE! Special edition events throughout the year keep children returning again and again. Level 5, Jalan Tun Perak. Wed-Sun 10am-6pm. 🧪💡", 'https://www.mosaic.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/MoSAIC%20-%20Museum%20of%20Science%2C%20Arts%20and%20Innovation%20for%20Children%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '5 km', '12-18 min', 3.1605, 101.6724),
    ('For Children', 'Kids Nation Bangsar', '🎪🎈 The beloved indoor playground expands to Bangsar! Thoughtfully designed for active play with all the essentials that keep kids energised and entertained. Perfect for quick playdates, birthday parties, or burning off afternoon energy. Intimate, curated play experience in a convenient location. Check out their attractive party packages! Open daily 10am-10pm. 🎂🤸', 'https://www.kidsnation.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kids%20Nation%20Bangsar%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '6 km', '12-20 min', 3.1158, 101.6851),
    ('For Children', 'Wondernest Playhouse Semenyih', '🎨🌟 Where exploration meets creation! This Semenyih gem features a thrilling indoor playground PLUS a high-tech sensory room that sparks wonder in every child. Their signature messy play and art workshops let kids learn through touch and colour - perfect for creative little minds! A guaranteed treat for your little ones. 11:30am-8:30pm daily. 🖌️👶', 'https://www.instagram.com/wondernestplayhouse', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Wondernest%20Playhouse%20Semenyih%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '40 km', '45-60 min', 3.0772, 101.521),
    ('For Children', 'Club Med Junior Padel @ The Campus', "🎾👶 Club Med brings resort-style sports to the city! Malaysia's FIRST Club Med-branded junior padel experience at The Campus, Ampang. New House of Padel Kids' School teaches young players the exciting racquet sport in a fun, structured programme. While kids play, parents can enjoy yoga at The Flow nearby. Premium sports fun! 🏆🌴", 'https://www.houseofpadel.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Club%20Med%20Junior%20Padel%20%40%20The%20Campus%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '10-15 min', 3.157, 101.7103),
    ('For Children', 'QQ Funland TF Value-Mart Batu Caves', '🛝🎪 Shop AND play! This family-friendly playground inside TF Value-Mart Batu Caves keeps kids entertained while parents grocery shop. Towering slides, generous ball pits, and safe play zones designed for active kids. The perfect way to reward little ones after a day of errands - and so conveniently located! Budget-friendly fun. 10am-10pm daily. 🛒🎉', 'https://www.tfmart.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/QQ%20Funland%20TF%20Value-Mart%20Batu%20Caves%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '13 km', '25-35 min', 3.073, 101.5005),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Whitewater Rafting, Selangor River', "🌊🚣 ADRENALINE EXPLOSION on Class II-III rapids! The Selangor River delivers heart-pounding thrills as you navigate churning whitewater through pristine jungle scenery. Paddle hard, scream louder, and get absolutely DRENCHED as your raft crashes through waves! Professional guides ensure safety while you conquer the rapids. The perfect team bonding or family adventure - you'll be laughing and high-fiving all the way! 💪🎉", 'https://ecotrac-adventure.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Whitewater%20Rafting%2C%20Selangor%20River%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '75 km', '1-1.5 hours', 3.0831, 101.5222),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'FRIM Canopy Walkway, Selangor', "🌳👀 WALK AMONG THE TREETOPS! At Forest Research Institute Malaysia, a thrilling 200-metre suspension bridge dangles 30 metres above the forest floor. Your heart races as the walkway sways gently while you're surrounded by ancient rainforest giants! Spot monkeys, birds, and exotic insects at eye level. The jungle trek to reach it is equally stunning. One of KL's most unique nature experiences! 🐒🦋", 'https://www.frim.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/FRIM%20Canopy%20Walkway%2C%20Selangor%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '18 km', '25-40 min', 3.0664, 101.4968),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Bukit Tabur Hike, KL', "⛰️🌅 The DRAGON'S BACK of KL! This dramatic quartz ridge offers jaw-dropping views that rival any world-class hike. Challenge yourself on the narrow rocky spine as Klang Gates Reservoir glitters far below. The sunrise trek is LEGENDARY - watch golden light paint the city while you stand on top of the world! Not for the faint-hearted, but absolutely worth every step. Adventure seekers' paradise! 🐉✨", 'https://www.tourismselangor.my/bukit-tabur', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bukit%20Tabur%20Hike%2C%20KL%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '18 km', '30-45 min', 3.1554, 101.6908),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Waterfall Abseiling, Kuala Kubu Bharu', "💧🧗 RAPPEL DOWN A THUNDERING WATERFALL! The ultimate adrenaline rush awaits as you descend through cascading water at Kuala Kubu Bharu's stunning waterfalls. Feel the spray on your face, hear the roar of water, and conquer your fears one rope length at a time! Certified guides ensure your safety while you experience nature's power up close. Absolutely EPIC for thrill-seekers! 🌈⚡", 'https://ecotrac-adventure.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Waterfall%20Abseiling%2C%20Kuala%20Kubu%20Bharu%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '80 km', '1.5-2 hours', 3.0991, 101.4904),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Rock Climbing, Batu Caves', "🧗\u200d♂️🏔️ CLIMB the legendary LIMESTONE CLIFFS! Batu Caves isn't just about temples - it's a world-class rock climbing destination with 160+ routes for all skill levels! Scale ancient limestone formations while monkeys cheer you on. The sense of achievement when you reach the top is unmatched. Professional guides and equipment available for beginners. Join Malaysia's thriving climbing community! 💪🙌", 'https://www.batucaves.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rock%20Climbing%2C%20Batu%20Caves%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '13 km', '25-35 min', 3.0539, 101.5349),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Gua Tempurung Caving, Perak', "🦇🔦 EXPLORE a 400-MILLION-YEAR-OLD underworld! Peninsular Malaysia's longest limestone cave system stretches 4.5km through spectacular chambers filled with otherworldly stalactites and underground rivers. Choose your adventure level: easy walkways or extreme wet & muddy expeditions! Crawl through narrow passages, wade through chest-deep water, and discover hidden caverns. An underground world like no other! 🌌💎", 'https://www.guatempurung.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Gua%20Tempurung%20Caving%2C%20Perak%20Malaysia', 'Perak', '180 km', '2-2.5 hours', 4.6235, 101.0872),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Paragliding, Bukit Jugra', "🪂☁️ SOAR LIKE AN EAGLE over Malaysia! Launch from Bukit Jugra's hilltop and glide through the sky with panoramic views of the Selangor coastline stretching endlessly below. Feel the wind, embrace freedom, and experience the world from a bird's perspective! Tandem flights with experienced pilots mean no experience needed. The most magical way to see Malaysia - pure flying freedom! 🌅🦅", 'https://www.paragliding.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Paragliding%2C%20Bukit%20Jugra%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '50 km', '50-70 min', 3.0476, 101.5059),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'ATV Adventure, Broga', '🏍️💨 OFF-ROAD MAYHEM through jungle and rubber plantations! Rev up powerful ATVs and tear through muddy trails, splash through streams, and conquer rugged terrain in beautiful Broga. Perfect for adrenaline junkies seeking dirty, dusty FUN! No experience needed - guides lead the way through varying difficulty trails. Finish absolutely filthy but grinning ear to ear! 🌴🔥', 'https://www.brogaatv.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/ATV%20Adventure%2C%20Broga%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '55 km', '1-1.5 hours', 3.0723, 101.5243),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Jungle Trekking, Taman Negara', "🌿🐘 130 MILLION YEARS of untouched wilderness! The world's OLDEST RAINFOREST awaits with canopy walks, night safaris, and trails through pristine jungle. Spot wild elephants, tigers, tapirs, and hundreds of bird species! Sleep in jungle camps, fish for dinner, and experience life as indigenous Orang Asli have for millennia. Malaysia's ultimate nature immersion! 🦎🌺", 'https://www.tamannegara.asia', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Jungle%20Trekking%2C%20Taman%20Negara%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '250 km', '3.5-4 hours', 3.784, 103.3476),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Ziplining, Gopeng Rainforest', "🌲💫 FLY through the ancient rainforest canopy! Gopeng's adventure parks feature multiple ziplines soaring over treetops, rivers, and valleys. Feel the rush as you zoom between platforms at thrilling speeds! The Treetop Challenge combines ziplines with obstacle courses for maximum adventure. Perfect for families and thrill-seekers alike. Your screams of joy echo through the jungle! 🎢🙈", 'https://www.gopengadventure.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ziplining%2C%20Gopeng%20Rainforest%20Malaysia', 'Perak', '170 km', '2-2.5 hours', 4.6219, 101.0954),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Stand-Up Paddleboarding, Lake Titiwangsa', "🏄\u200d♀️🌃 PADDLE with KL's skyline as your backdrop! Glide across serene Lake Titiwangsa as the iconic Petronas Twin Towers shimmer in the distance. Perfect for beginners - the calm waters make balancing easy while you enjoy stunning city views. Sunrise and sunset sessions are pure magic! A peaceful escape right in the heart of the capital. Urban zen at its finest! 🌅🧘", 'https://www.klpaddleboard.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Stand-Up%20Paddleboarding%2C%20Lake%20Titiwangsa%20Malaysia', 'Kuala Lumpur', '5 km', '12-18 min', 3.1601, 101.6948),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Cameron Highlands Camping, Pahang', "⛺🌙 ESCAPE TO COOL MOUNTAIN AIR! Camp among tea plantations and strawberry farms in Malaysia's most beloved highland retreat. Temperatures drop to 15°C at night - perfect for campfires and stargazing! Wake to misty mornings, hike through mossy forests, and spot rare Rafflesia flowers. The anti-beach vacation that Malaysians absolutely LOVE! 🍓☕", 'https://www.cameronhighlands.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cameron%20Highlands%20Camping%2C%20Pahang%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '200 km', '3-3.5 hours', 3.8421, 103.3203),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Kayaking, Klang River', "🛶🏙️ URBAN ADVENTURE through KL's historic waterways! Paddle the rivers that gave Kuala Lumpur its name (Muddy Confluence!) while passing colonial buildings, bustling markets, and secret spots tourists never see. Expert guides share fascinating history as you navigate calm waters. A completely unique perspective on the capital - adventure meets culture! 🌆📸", 'https://www.klkayak.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kayaking%2C%20Klang%20River%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '12 km', '20-30 min', 3.0589, 101.5252),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Cycling, Putrajaya', "🚴\u200d♂️🌺 PEDAL THROUGH a futuristic garden city! Putrajaya's 650+ hectares of lakes, parks, and boulevards are PERFECT for cycling. Rent bikes and cruise past stunning architecture, botanical gardens, and the famous Pink Mosque! Dedicated cycling paths make it safe for families. The sunset route around Putrajaya Lake is absolutely magical! 🌅🌳", 'https://www.putrajaya.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cycling%2C%20Putrajaya%20Malaysia', 'Putrajaya', '30 km', '35-50 min', 2.9517, 101.7196),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', '4x4 Off-Road Adventure, Janda Baik', "🚙💥 CONQUER THE WILD TERRAIN! Just 45 minutes from KL, Janda Baik's rugged jungle trails challenge even experienced drivers. Steep inclines, deep mud pits, and river crossings test your skills while guides ensure safety. Feel the POWER as your 4x4 conquers seemingly impossible obstacles! End the day at jungle waterfalls. Ultimate weekend warrior adventure! 🏞️🔥", 'https://www.jandabaikadventure.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/4x4%20Off-Road%20Adventure%2C%20Janda%20Baik%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '50 km', '50-70 min', 3.8144, 103.3441),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Langkawi Island', "🏝️✨ The JEWEL of Kedah! This duty-free paradise offers pristine beaches, dramatic limestone formations, and legendary tales. Cable car to Langkawi Sky Bridge for breathtaking views, island-hop to hidden coves, explore mangrove forests, and witness majestic eagles soaring. Halal food everywhere, beautiful mosques, and stunning sunsets. Malaysia's premier beach destination with world-class resorts! 🦅🌅", 'https://www.langkawi-info.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Langkawi%20Island%20Malaysia', 'Kedah', '470 km', 'Flight 1 hr', 6.1395, 100.3449),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Perhentian Islands', '🐢🌊 Paradise for snorkelers! Crystal-clear waters teeming with sea turtles, colorful coral reefs, and tropical fish. Two main islands - Perhentian Besar (Big) for families and Perhentian Kecil (Small) for backpackers. No cars, no stress - just pristine beaches and incredible marine life. Halal seafood restaurants line the beaches. Best visited March-October! 🐠💙', 'https://www.malaysia.travel/perhentian', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Perhentian%20Islands%20Malaysia', 'Terengganu', '500 km', '6-7 hours + boat', 5.2949, 103.1596),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Redang Island', "💎🏖️ Marine park PERFECTION! One of Malaysia's most beautiful islands with powder-white sand and turquoise waters. Protected marine park means incredible snorkeling and diving with vibrant coral gardens. All-inclusive resorts make planning easy. Sea turtle conservation programs let you witness nature's miracle. Halal resort dining throughout! 🐢🌺", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/redang', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Redang%20Island%20Malaysia', 'Terengganu', '480 km', '5-6 hours + boat', 5.3396, 103.1276),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Tioman Island', '🦎🌴 Legendary beauty that inspired Bali Hai! This volcanic island offers dramatic jungle-covered peaks, hidden waterfalls, and world-class diving. Duty-free status means great shopping. Abundant wildlife including monitor lizards and hornbills. Resorts range from budget to luxury, all with halal options. A true tropical escape! 🌊⛰️', 'https://www.malaysia.travel/tioman', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tioman%20Island%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '200 km', '4-5 hours + ferry', 3.8398, 103.3008),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Pangkor Island', "🎣🌅 The CLOSEST island paradise to KL! Just 3.5 hours away, this charming island offers beautiful beaches, fresh seafood, and peaceful kampung vibes. Visit the historic Dutch Fort, spot hornbills at sunset, and enjoy some of Malaysia's freshest halal seafood. Perfect for a quick beach getaway without the long journey! 🏝️😌", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/pangkor', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pangkor%20Island%20Malaysia', 'Perak', '230 km', '3.5-4 hrs + ferry', 4.6124, 101.1015),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Sipadan Island', "🤿🐋 World's TOP dive site! This oceanic island rises 600m from the sea floor, creating a marine wonderland. Encounter hammerhead sharks, barracuda tornadoes, and sea turtle highways. Limited daily permits protect this UNESCO-worthy ecosystem. Serious divers' bucket list destination. Stay in nearby Mabul or Semporna (halal options available). 🦈🐢", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/sipadan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sipadan%20Island%20Malaysia', 'Sabah', '1,700 km', 'Flight 2.5 hrs + boat', 5.9744, 116.0828),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Rawa Island', "💫🏖️ Exclusive PRIVATE island paradise! This tiny gem off Johor's coast offers crystal waters without the crowds. Only two resorts on the entire island mean serenity guaranteed. Snorkel vibrant reefs steps from your room, kayak to hidden coves, and enjoy fresh halal seafood under the stars. Perfect for honeymoons and peaceful retreats! 🌙✨", 'https://www.rawaislandresort.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rawa%20Island%20Malaysia', 'Johor', '380 km', '4-5 hours + boat', 1.4754, 103.7229),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Kapas Island', "🌸🐚 The 'Cotton Island' lives up to its name! Soft white sand, calm turquoise waters, and laid-back vibes make this Terengganu gem perfect for families. Affordable accommodation, excellent snorkeling, and delicious halal seafood. Less crowded than Perhentian, equally beautiful. Best kept secret of Malaysia's East Coast! 🏝️💕", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/kapas', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kapas%20Island%20Malaysia', 'Terengganu', '450 km', '5-6 hours + boat', 5.3036, 103.1172),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Mantanani Islands', '🐄🌊 Swim with DUGONGS! These remote Sabah islands are one of few places to spot gentle sea cows in their natural habitat. Pristine beaches, excellent diving, and untouched beauty await adventurous travelers. Basic but comfortable accommodation with halal food. A true off-the-beaten-path Malaysian paradise! 🐬🏝️', 'https://www.sabahtourism.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mantanani%20Islands%20Malaysia', 'Sabah', '1,550 km', 'Flight 2.5 hrs + boat', 5.9544, 116.0708),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Desaru Coast', "🏖️🎢 Malaysia's NEWEST beach resort destination! Just opened luxury integrated resort with pristine 17km beach. Adventure waterpark, world-class golf, luxury hotels, and family attractions. Easy access from Singapore and JB. All halal dining options. The future of Malaysian beach tourism is HERE! ⛳🌴", 'https://www.desarucoast.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Desaru%20Coast%20Malaysia', 'Johor', '350 km', '4-4.5 hours', 1.506, 103.758),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Port Dickson', "🌊👨\u200d👩\u200d👧\u200d👦 KL's favorite beach escape! Just 90 minutes from the city, PD offers family-friendly beaches, waterfront resorts, and the iconic Army Museum. Perfect for quick weekend getaways. Lots of halal restaurants and seafood options. Blue Lagoon and Teluk Kemang are top beach spots. Easy, affordable beach fun! 🏖️😊", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/portdickson', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Port%20Dickson%20Malaysia', 'Negeri Sembilan', '100 km', '1.5-2 hours', 2.7386, 101.9143),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Cherating Beach', '🐢🌴 Turtle sanctuary on the East Coast! This bohemian beach town is famous for sea turtle conservation - watch baby turtles released to the sea! Great surfing waves, firefly tours, and authentic kampung atmosphere. Club Med resort here, plus budget chalets. All halal, all natural, all amazing! 🏄\u200d♂️🐢', 'https://www.malaysia.travel/cherating', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cherating%20Beach%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '300 km', '3.5-4 hours', 3.8353, 103.3128),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'Jalan Alor Night Food Street', "🍢🔥 KL's most FAMOUS food street comes alive after dark! Sizzling woks, aromatic satay smoke, and hundreds of halal stalls serving Malaysia's best street food. Grilled seafood, char kway teow, rojak, and more! The ultimate Malaysian food adventure - arrive hungry, leave happy! 🌙🍜", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/jalan-alor', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Jalan%20Alor%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', '1.5 km', '8-12 min', 3.1415, 101.684),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'Taman Connaught Night Market', "🛒🌃 Wednesday night MEGA market! One of KL's largest pasar malam stretching over 2km with 700+ stalls. Halal street food galore - ramly burgers, murtabak, apam balik, fresh juices. Plus clothing, accessories, and gadgets. Come early for the best selection! 📱👕", 'https://www.kualalumpur.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Taman%20Connaught%20Night%20Market%20KL', 'Kuala Lumpur', '8 km', '20-30 min', 3.1196, 101.659),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'SS2 Night Market', "🥘🌙 Monday & Thursday local favorite! Petaling Jaya's beloved pasar malam with excellent halal Malay and Indian food. Nasi lemak, roti john, vadai, and traditional kuih. Less touristy, more authentic. True Malaysian night market experience! 🍛✨", 'https://www.selangor.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/SS2%20Night%20Market%20Petaling%20Jaya', 'Selangor', '12 km', '20-30 min', 3.0452, 101.529),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'Setia Alam Night Market', "🎪🍔 Saturday night SPECTACULAR! Selangor's biggest pasar malam with over 800 stalls. Endless halal food - from Western fusion to traditional Malay. Family-friendly atmosphere, live entertainment. Worth the drive for serious night market fans! 🎡🌟", 'https://www.selangor.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Setia%20Alam%20Night%20Market%20Selangor', 'Selangor', '30 km', '40-55 min', 3.081, 101.5045),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'Bazaar Ramadan (Seasonal)', "🌙☪️ The HOLIEST food experience! During Ramadan, bazaars pop up everywhere selling iftar delights - kurma, murtabak, ayam percik, bubur lambuk. Experience the blessed month's culinary traditions. Different locations daily - check local listings! 🕌🍽️", 'https://www.malaysia.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bazaar%20Ramadan%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Nationwide', 'Various', 'Various', 3.1361, 101.6974),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'REXKL', "🎭🎨 KL's coolest creative hub! This restored 1970s cinema hosts markets, art exhibitions, live performances, and halal F&B. Weekend markets showcase local designers and artisans. Cultural events celebrate Malaysian creativity. Hip, happening, halal! 🎬✨", 'https://www.rfrexkl.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/REXKL%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '10-15 min', 3.117, 101.6983),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'Petaling Street Night Scene', '🏮🛍️ Chinatown after dark! Red lanterns glow as the famous market transforms into a bustling night bazaar. Halal Malay and Indian food stalls alongside the action. Great for bargain hunting and soaking up old KL atmosphere. Historic vibes! 🐉🌃', 'https://www.kualalumpur.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Petaling%20Street%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '12-18 min', 3.1532, 101.6698),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'Atmosphere 360 Revolving Restaurant', "🗼🍽️ Dine in the CLOUDS! Malaysia's only revolving restaurant atop KL Tower offers 360° city views. Halal buffet with local and international cuisine. Watch the city sparkle below while you feast. Book sunset timing for magic! 🌅✨", 'https://www.atmosphere360.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Atmosphere%20360%20KL%20Tower', 'Kuala Lumpur', '3 km', '10-15 min', 3.1208, 101.663),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'Heli Lounge Bar (Mocktails)', "🚁🌃 Rooftop on a HELIPAD! Stunning 360° views from an actual helicopter landing pad. Order mocktails and fresh juices while watching KL's skyline glitter. One of the world's most unique rooftop experiences. Dress smart casual! 🏙️⭐", 'https://www.heliloungebar.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Heli%20Lounge%20Bar%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', '2 km', '8-12 min', 3.1648, 101.6574),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'SkyBar at Traders Hotel', "🌃☕ Twin Towers view perfection! This iconic rooftop offers Malaysia's most photographed skyline views. Halal snacks and non-alcoholic beverages available. Perfect for sunset watching and stunning night photography. Smart casual dress code! 📸💫", 'https://www.shangri-la.com/traders', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/SkyBar%20Traders%20Hotel%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0.2 km', '5 min', 3.1626, 101.6682),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', "Marini's on 57", '🏔️☕ Highest rooftop in Malaysia! Located on the 57th floor with unparalleled Petronas views. Serves mocktails, coffee, and halal desserts. Ultra-sophisticated atmosphere for special occasions. Reservations recommended for sunset! 🌅👔', 'https://www.marinis57.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Marini%27s%20on%2057%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0.3 km', '5 min', 3.1194, 101.7094),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'Lake Gardens Evening Stroll', "🌳🌙 Peaceful evening escape! KL's green lung transforms at sunset - families picnicking, joggers on trails, paddle boats on the lake. Visit nearby Masjid Negara for Maghrib prayers. Perfect halal family evening activity. Free entry! 🏞️🦢", 'https://www.klbotanicalgarden.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lake%20Gardens%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', '4 km', '12-18 min', 3.1389, 101.6896),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'KLCC Park Fountain Show', '⛲✨ FREE nightly spectacular! The stunning Symphony Lake fountain show runs every evening with choreographed water, lights, and music. Families gather on the lawn, kids play nearby. Perfect post-dinner activity with Petronas Towers backdrop! 🌃💦', 'https://www.suriaklcc.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/KLCC%20Park%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', '0 km', 'At KLCC', 3.1445, 101.7004),
    ('Night Markets & Entertainment', 'I-City Shah Alam Light Show', '💡🎪 City of DIGITAL lights! This entertainment complex dazzles with millions of LED lights transforming the night. Rides, food courts (all halal), and Instagram-worthy photo spots everywhere. Great family night out! Weekends get crowded - come early! 🎡🌈', 'https://www.i-city.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/I-City%20Shah%20Alam%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '35 km', '40-55 min', 3.0563, 101.5168),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Malacca (Melaka) UNESCO City', "🏛️🇵🇹 Malaysia's HISTORIC gem! This UNESCO World Heritage city tells 600 years of history through Portuguese forts, Dutch churches, and British buildings. Visit A Famosa fortress, Jonker Street night market, and cruise the Malacca River at sunset. Amazing halal Nyonya cuisine! A must-do day trip! 🌅🏰", 'https://www.melaka.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Malacca%20City%20Malaysia', 'Melaka', '150 km', '2-2.5 hours', 2.169, 102.2389),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Ipoh Heritage City', "☕🍜 Malaysia's hipster heritage town! This charming city boasts stunning colonial architecture, famous cave temples, and legendary halal cuisine. Try Ipoh white coffee, nasi ganja, and salt-baked chicken. Street art, limestone hills, and authentic old-world charm. Perfect foodie day trip! 🎨🏔️", 'https://www.ipoh.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ipoh%20Malaysia', 'Perak', '200 km', '2.5-3 hours', 4.592, 101.0669),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Cameron Highlands', "🍓🌿 Cool mountain escape! This British-era hill station offers tea plantations stretching to horizons, strawberry farms, and cool 18-22°C temperatures. Visit BOH Tea Centre, Lavender Garden, and Night Market for fresh produce. Perfect respite from KL's heat! 🫖🌸", 'https://www.cameronhighlands.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cameron%20Highlands%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '200 km', '3-3.5 hours', 3.7861, 103.3452),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Kuala Selangor Fireflies', '✨🌙 MAGICAL evening experience! Witness thousands of fireflies synchronizing their lights along the mangrove-lined Selangor River. Take a traditional sampan boat through the glowing darkness. Also visit the historic fort and silver-leaf monkey sanctuary. Unforgettable! 🚣\u200d♀️🌟', 'https://www.selangor.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kuala%20Selangor%20Fireflies%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '65 km', '1-1.5 hours', 3.0589, 101.5403),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Sekinchan Paddy Fields', '🌾📸 Instagram paradise! This charming fishing village features endless emerald rice paddies that turn golden at harvest. Visit the Wishing Tree, unique cafes, and fresh seafood restaurants (halal options). Best photo opportunities at sunrise! 🌅🍚', 'https://www.selangor.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sekinchan%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '100 km', '1.5-2 hours', 3.1031, 101.5024),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Putrajaya Administrative Capital', "🕌🏛️ Malaysia's stunning planned city! Marvel at the pink Putra Mosque floating on the lake, visit the Prime Minister's Office (Perdana Putra), and enjoy Putrajaya Lake boat rides. Beautiful Islamic architecture and peaceful lakeside walks. Free entry most attractions! 🌅🏰", 'https://www.putrajaya.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Putrajaya%20Malaysia', 'Putrajaya', '30 km', '35-50 min', 2.9037, 101.6805),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Genting Highlands', "🎢❄️ Theme park in the CLOUDS! Malaysia's hilltop entertainment city offers cool mountain air, casino-free family zones, indoor theme parks, and shopping. SkyWorld Theme Park now open! Cable car ride offers spectacular jungle views. Cool escape from tropical heat! 🚡🎡", 'https://www.rwgenting.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Genting%20Highlands%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '55 km', '1-1.5 hours', 3.8144, 103.3434),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Tanjung Sepat Seaside Town', "🌊🥟 Charming coastal escape! This fishing town is famous for its lover's bridge, fresh halal seafood, traditional bakeries, and scenic seaside views. Visit the iconic red bridge, try the famous 'pau' (buns), and enjoy peaceful kampung atmosphere. Great half-day trip! 🌅🦐", 'https://www.selangor.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tanjung%20Sepat%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '80 km', '1.5 hours', 3.0704, 101.501),
    ('Day Trips from KL', "Fraser's Hill", '🐦🌲 Colonial hill station frozen in time! This quiet retreat offers cooler temperatures, Tudor-style architecture, bird watching, and peaceful nature walks. Less crowded than Cameron Highlands. Perfect for those seeking tranquility and highland air. Misty mornings magical! 🌫️🏡', 'https://www.pahang.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Fraser%27s%20Hill%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '100 km', '2-2.5 hours', 3.8186, 103.305),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Kuala Gandah Elephant Sanctuary', '🐘💚 Meet gentle giants! This government elephant conservation center rescues and rehabilitates wild elephants. Watch feeding sessions, learn about conservation, and get up close to these magnificent animals. Educational and heartwarming experience. FREE entry! 🌿❤️', 'https://www.wildlife.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kuala%20Gandah%20Elephant%20Sanctuary%20Malaysia', 'Pahang', '110 km', '1.5-2 hours', 3.8005, 103.309),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Royal Klang Heritage Walk', "👑🕌 Royal town exploration! Visit Sultan's palace (exterior), historic Royal Mausoleum, and beautiful mosques. This royal town has deep Malay heritage and excellent seafood (famous for bak kut teh alternatives - halal options available). Just 40 minutes from KL! 🏰🌙", 'https://www.selangor.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Klang%20Royal%20Town%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '35 km', '40-50 min', 3.0767, 101.4923),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Broga Hill Sunrise Trek', '🌄⛰️ Epic sunrise adventure! This beginner-friendly hill offers stunning panoramic views at dawn. 400m elevation, 30-40 min climb. Watch the sky transform through golden hues as mist rolls over palm oil plantations. Start by 5:30am for best experience! 🥾✨', 'https://www.selangor.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Broga%20Hill%20Malaysia', 'Selangor', '55 km', '1-1.5 hours', 3.0829, 101.5248),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Kuching Waterfront', "🌆🐈 Malaysia's most charming riverside promenade! Stroll along the Sarawak River past colonial-era buildings, the golden State Mosque, and quirky cat statues honoring Kuching's 'Cat City' nickname. Food stalls, night markets, and a Chinese pagoda line the walk - hop on a traditional tambang boat to cross the river at sunset for the ultimate photo! 🚤🌇", 'https://sarawak.travel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kuching%20Waterfront%20Sarawak%20Malaysia', 'Sarawak', '1,450 km', 'Flight 2 hrs', 1.5484, 110.3874),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Sarawak Cultural Village', "🏘️🎭 A LIVING museum of Borneo's tribes! Seven authentic longhouses recreate the traditions of Iban, Bidayuh, Melanau, Orang Ulu and Malay communities under one roof. Watch blowpipe demonstrations, sample tribal delicacies, and catch a mesmerizing cultural dance show. The perfect crash course in Sarawak's incredible ethnic diversity! 🪈🌴", 'https://scv.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sarawak%20Cultural%20Village%20Malaysia', 'Sarawak', '1,470 km', 'Flight 2 hrs', 1.5639, 110.3510),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Semenggoh Wildlife Centre', "🦧🌳 Meet Borneo's gentle giants in the WILD! This rehabilitation centre for rescued orangutans lets you watch semi-wild apes swing through the rainforest canopy during feeding times. No cages, no bars - just pure jungle magic as these incredible primates forage just metres away. An unforgettable, humbling encounter! 🍌🌿", 'https://sarawakforestry.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Semenggoh%20Wildlife%20Centre%20Malaysia', 'Sarawak', '1,460 km', 'Flight 2 hrs', 1.5491, 110.3813),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Bako National Park', "🌊🏞️ Borneo's oldest national park PACKS a punch! Dramatic sea cliffs, sandstone rock formations, and jungle trails teeming with proboscis monkeys and bearded pigs await just a short boat ride from Kuching. Choose from easy boardwalks to full-day treks - every trail rewards you with jaw-dropping coastal views! 🐒⛰️", 'https://sarawakforestry.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bako%20National%20Park%20Malaysia', 'Sarawak', '1,480 km', 'Flight 2 hrs + boat', 1.5557, 110.3712),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Pasar Siti Khadijah, Kota Bharu', "🧕🛍️ The market run by WOMEN traders! This iconic pyramid-roofed central market has been female-dominated for generations, embodying Kelantanese women's legendary business spirit. Bright batik, fresh produce, dried keropok and traditional kuih spill across two lively floors. A proud symbol of Kelantan's matriarchal trading culture! 🌶️🧺", 'https://www.kelantan.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pasar%20Siti%20Khadijah%20Kota%20Bharu%20Malaysia', 'Kelantan', '480 km', '6-7 hours', 6.1349, 102.2422),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Istana Balai Besar, Kota Bharu', "👑🏯 Step into Kelantan's ROYAL heart! This ornate 19th-century audience hall, still used for royal ceremonies, anchors Kota Bharu's Islamic Heritage Zone alongside craft museums and war memorials. Intricate wood carvings and traditional Kelantanese architecture tell the story of a sultanate proud of its Malay-Islamic identity! 🕌📜", 'https://www.kelantan.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Istana%20Balai%20Besar%20Kota%20Bharu%20Malaysia', 'Kelantan', '480 km', '6-7 hours', 6.1013, 102.2290),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Pantai Cahaya Bulan (PCB)', "🌙🏖️ Moonlight Beach lives up to its poetic name! This East Coast stretch of casuarina-lined sand near Kota Bharu is a favourite for family picnics, kite-flying, and fresh grilled seafood at the beachside stalls. Gentle waves and golden sunsets make it a peaceful escape from Kelantan's bustling markets! 🌊🌅", 'https://www.kelantan.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pantai%20Cahaya%20Bulan%20Kelantan%20Malaysia', 'Kelantan', '495 km', '6-7 hours', 6.1526, 102.2163),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Perlis State Park, Kaki Bukit', "🦇🕳️ Malaysia's SMALLEST state hides a giant secret! Perlis State Park protects ancient limestone karst forest riddled with caves - including Gua Kelam, a 370m tunnel you walk through on a suspended wooden walkway above a rushing stream. Rare hornbills and langurs roam the forest canopy above! 🌿🦅", 'https://www.perlis.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Perlis%20State%20Park%20Kaki%20Bukit%20Malaysia', 'Perlis', '520 km', '6-7 hours', 6.4559, 100.1990),
    ('Day Trips from KL', 'Wang Kelian Border Market', "🛍️🇹🇭 Malaysia meets Thailand at this lively border bazaar! Wang Kelian's weekend market draws bargain-hunters across the frontier for cheap textiles, snacks and souvenirs, while the surrounding karst hills offer some of Perlis's most dramatic scenery. A quirky, off-the-beaten-path stop for the adventurous! 🏔️🧺", 'https://www.perlis.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Wang%20Kelian%20Perlis%20Malaysia', 'Perlis', '535 km', '6-7 hours', 6.4152, 100.2130),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Labuan War Cemetery', "🕊️🌺 A serene tribute to WWII heroes! This immaculately kept Commonwealth War Graves cemetery honours Allied servicemen who died in the Borneo campaign. Manicured lawns, rows of white headstones, and quiet reflection pools make this a moving, peaceful stop on Labuan's federal territory island. 🌿🙏", 'https://www.labuan.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Labuan%20War%20Cemetery%20Malaysia', 'Labuan', '1,650 km', 'Flight 2.5 hrs + ferry', 5.2978, 115.2368),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Labuan Bird Park', "🦜🌴 A tropical aviary paradise on Labuan Island! Wander through Southeast Asia's largest man-made walk-in aviary, home to colourful hornbills, parrots and exotic birds from across the region. Landscaped gardens and a butterfly park round out a relaxing half-day escape on this duty-free island! 🦋🌸", 'https://www.labuan.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Labuan%20Bird%20Park%20Malaysia', 'Labuan', '1,650 km', 'Flight 2.5 hrs + ferry', 5.2750, 115.2450),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Langkawi Sky Bridge', "🌉☁️ Walk among the CLOUDS! This curved 125-metre pedestrian bridge suspends 700m above sea level atop Mount Mat Cincang, reached by a heart-stopping cable car ride. Panoramic views stretch across Langkawi's rainforest canopy to the Andaman Sea and even Thailand on clear days! 📸🏔️", 'https://www.langkawi-sky-bridge.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Langkawi%20Sky%20Bridge%20Malaysia', 'Kedah', '470 km', 'Flight 1 hr', 6.3748, 99.8074),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Langkawi Cable Car (Panorama Langkawi)', "🚡🏝️ Soar above ancient rainforest on Southeast Asia's steepest cable car! Panorama Langkawi whisks you up Mount Mat Cincang in minutes, delivering jaw-dropping views of jungle, sea and neighbouring islands. The ride itself is half the thrill - hold on tight through the steep middle section! 🌳✨", 'https://www.panoramalangkawi.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Langkawi%20Cable%20Car%20Malaysia', 'Kedah', '470 km', 'Flight 1 hr', 6.3515, 99.7822),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Kilim Karst Geoforest Park, Langkawi', "🦅🚤 Cruise through a mangrove wonderland! Kilim's limestone karst cliffs and dense mangrove forest are home to fish farms, bat caves, and the star attraction - majestic Brahminy kites and white-bellied sea eagles swooping for fish right beside your boat. A must for nature lovers! 🐟🌿", 'https://www.langkawigeopark.com.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kilim%20Karst%20Geoforest%20Park%20Malaysia', 'Kedah', '475 km', 'Flight 1 hr + boat', 6.3504, 99.8199),
    ('Places to Visit', 'George Town UNESCO Heritage Zone', "🏛️🎨 A UNESCO World Heritage living museum! George Town's shophouse-lined streets burst with colour - vibrant street art murals, ornate clan houses, and a mouthwatering mix of Peranakan, Chinese, Indian and Malay heritage side by side. Wander for hours discovering hidden temples, mosques and legendary hawker stalls around every corner! 🖼️🍜", 'https://www.penang.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/George%20Town%20UNESCO%20Heritage%20Penang%20Malaysia', 'Penang', '350 km', '4-5 hours', 5.4041, 100.3588),
    ('Places to Visit', 'Penang Hill', "🚞⛰️ Escape the heat 830m above George Town! Malaysia's oldest funicular railway climbs steeply through rainforest to cool hilltop views over the whole island and mainland beyond. Catch a canopy walk, colonial bungalows, and a mosque and Hindu temple sharing the summit in perfect harmony! 🌤️🌳", 'https://www.penanghill.gov.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Penang%20Hill%20Malaysia', 'Penang', '355 km', '4-5 hours', 5.4069, 100.3169),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Kinabalu Park (Mount Kinabalu)', "🏔️🌄 Southeast Asia's HIGHEST peak! This UNESCO World Heritage park protects Mount Kinabalu's dramatic granite summit, towering 4,095m above lush rainforest teeming with rare orchids and pitcher plants. Serious climbers summit overnight for sunrise; everyone else enjoys cool mountain air, botanical gardens and hot springs at the base! 🌸🥾", 'https://www.sabahparks.org.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kinabalu%20Park%20Malaysia', 'Sabah', '1,700 km', 'Flight 2.5 hrs', 6.0015, 116.0859),
    ('Outdoor Adventures', 'Sepilok Orangutan Rehabilitation Centre', "🦧❤️ Meet Borneo's gentle giants up close! This world-renowned sanctuary rescues and rehabilitates orphaned orangutans, releasing them back into protected rainforest. Watch feeding time from raised platforms as these incredible apes swing in for breakfast - an emotional, unforgettable Bornean highlight! 🍌🌴", 'https://www.orangutan-appeal.org.uk', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sepilok%20Orangutan%20Rehabilitation%20Centre%20Malaysia', 'Sabah', '1,750 km', 'Flight 2.5 hrs + drive', 5.9664, 116.0849),
    ('Beaches & Islands', 'Island Hopping - Sapi & Manukan', "🏝️🤿 Crystal-clear water just minutes from the city! Tunku Abdul Rahman Marine Park's islands - Sapi and Manukan - are a 15-minute boat ride from Kota Kinabalu, offering powder-white beaches, vibrant coral snorkelling, and jungle trails. The perfect easy beach day for every fitness level! 🐠☀️", 'https://www.sabahparks.org.my', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pulau%20Sapi%20Manukan%20Malaysia', 'Sabah', '1,600 km', 'Flight 2.5 hrs + boat', 5.9838, 116.0986),
]

# name, description, photo_url
FOOD = [
    ('Nasi Lemak', "🍚 The dish that defines a nation! Nasi Lemak is Malaysia's edible national treasure—fragrant coconut rice infused with pandan aroma, crowned with a fiery sambal that'll awaken every taste bud. Crunchy roasted peanuts dance with crispy anchovies, a perfectly boiled egg adds richness, and the banana leaf wrapper releases intoxicating aromas with every unwrap. From humble street corners to five-star hotels, this breakfast champion unites all Malaysians. One bite and you'll understand why leaving Malaysia without tasting Nasi Lemak is simply not allowed!", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/food/nasi-lemak'),
    ('Roti Canai', "🫓 Watch culinary magic unfold before your eyes! Roti Canai is Malaysia's mesmerizing flying bread—dough spun through the air like pizza acrobatics, stretched impossibly thin, then folded into flaky, golden perfection. Tear off a piece, dip into creamy dhal curry or fiery sambal, and experience texture heaven: crispy outside, soft inside, utterly addictive. Found sizzling at Mamak stalls island-wide, this 24/7 comfort food brings midnight cravings and breakfast traditions together. The show is free—the taste is priceless!", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/food/roti-canai'),
    ('Rendang', "🍖 The dish so legendary, it takes 4 hours to perfect! Rendang is not just curry—it's a labor of love, where tender beef absorbs an orchestra of spices: galangal singing, lemongrass dancing, coconut cream enriching every fiber. Braised until almost dry, the meat becomes impossibly tender, coated in intensely flavored goodness. Served at weddings, festivals, and family gatherings, Rendang actually tastes BETTER the next day as flavors deepen. Keep it room temperature for days, refrigerated for weeks—this dish ages like fine wine!", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/food/rendang'),
    ('Satay', "🔥 Follow your nose to paradise! The sweet smoke of Satay grilling over charcoal flames is Malaysia's most irresistible siren call. Perfectly marinated meat—tender chicken, succulent beef, or robust mutton—threaded on skewers and kissed by fire until caramelized perfection. But the star? That legendary peanut sauce: creamy, slightly sweet, with a chili kick that keeps you reaching for more. Found everywhere from night markets to family celebrations, Satay is Malaysia's ultimate sharing food. One stick is never enough—trust us!", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/food/satay'),
    ('Laksa', "🍜🔥 Malaysia's ULTIMATE soul-warming noodle soup comes in two legendary forms! Asam Laksa: tangy, sour fish-based broth from Penang that'll make your taste buds dance. Curry Laksa: rich, coconut-based spicy paradise topped with prawns, tofu puffs, and cockles. Malaysians passionately debate which is better - smart travelers try BOTH! Available everywhere from hawker stalls to restaurants. 🌶️💕", 'https://www.tourism.gov.my'),
    ('Nasi Kandar', "🍛🌈 Penang's LEGENDARY rice dish is a flavour explosion! Start with steamed rice, then pile on curries - fish, chicken, beef, vegetables - the MORE gravies mixed, the BETTER (locals call it 'banjir' - flooded!). Each combination creates a unique taste symphony. Open 24/7 at famous spots, this dish fuels night owls and early birds alike. Experience the original at Line Clear or Hameediyah! 🌙✨", 'https://www.tourism.gov.my'),
    ('Cendol', "🍧💚 The ULTIMATE tropical cooldown! Shaved ice mountain drizzled with coconut milk, palm sugar (gula melaka), red beans, and those iconic green rice flour jelly noodles. Watch vendors shave ice before your eyes, then drench it in sweet, creamy goodness. Found everywhere from roadside stalls to Michelin-mentioned hawkers. Perfect afternoon pick-me-up when Malaysia's heat hits! 🌴☀️", 'https://www.tourism.gov.my'),
    ('Apam Balik', "🥞🥜 Malaysia's BELOVED street pancake! This crispy-chewy treat comes stuffed with crushed peanuts, sugar, and sweet corn. Watch skilled vendors flip these golden beauties on round griddles at night markets nationwide. Choose thin & crispy or thick & fluffy - both are dangerously addictive! Perfect post-dinner snack that keeps you coming back for 'just one more'. Budget-friendly at RM2-5! 🌙😋", 'https://www.tourism.gov.my'),
    ('Nasi Kerabu', "💙🌿 The STUNNING blue rice from Malaysia's East Coast! Natural butterfly pea flower gives this Kelantanese dish its Instagram-famous colour. Served with fresh herbs, fish crackers, grilled fish, and a symphony of sambal and coconut. It's a full sensory experience - beautiful, aromatic, and bursting with fresh, healthy flavours. A must-try for food adventurers seeking something truly unique! 🐟✨", 'https://www.tourism.gov.my'),
    ('Teh Tarik', "☕🥛 Malaysia's NATIONAL drink! Literally 'pulled tea' - watch mesmerizing high-pouring of creamy milk tea between cups. The frothy, sweet, aromatic result is addictive! Found everywhere from street stalls to cafes. Best with roti canai! Must try! 🫖✨", 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Teh%20Tarik%20Malaysia'),
    ('Mee Goreng Mamak', '🍜🔥 Iconic street food! Spicy stir-fried yellow noodles with egg, vegetables, and tangy sauce. Mamak version is legendary - available 24/7 at mamak stalls. Crispy edges, savory sauce, perfectly balanced. Ultimate late-night comfort food! 🥢🌶️', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mamak%20Restaurant%20Malaysia'),
    ('Mee Rebus', '🍜💛 Soul-warming noodles! Yellow noodles in thick, sweet potato-based gravy, topped with hard-boiled egg, tofu, and lime. Rich, slightly sweet, utterly comforting. A Malay classic that satisfies every craving! 🥚🌿', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mee%20Rebus%20Malaysia'),
    ('Ais Kacang / ABC', '🍧🌈 Rainbow shaved ice dessert! Mountains of fluffy ice drizzled with colorful syrups, topped with red beans, sweet corn, jelly, and ice cream. Perfect tropical refreshment! Also called Air Batu Campur. Kids absolutely LOVE it! 🌴❄️', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/ABC%20Ice%20Dessert%20Malaysia'),
    ('Cendol', "🥥💚 ICONIC coconut dessert! Green pandan jelly 'worms' swimming in coconut milk with palm sugar (gula melaka) and shaved ice. Sweet, fragrant, refreshing. Best from traditional stalls. Summer in a bowl! 🌴🍃", 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cendol%20Malaysia'),
    ('Rojak', '🥗🥜 Explosive fruit salad! Fresh fruits and vegetables (jicama, cucumber, pineapple, mango) with thick sweet-spicy peanut sauce. Crunchy, sweet, tangy, and slightly spicy. Unique Malaysian flavor bomb! 🌶️🍍', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Rojak%20Malaysia'),
    ('Popiah', '🥢🥬 Fresh spring rolls! Thin wheat crepe wrapped around jicama, carrots, eggs, and sweet sauce. Light, healthy, and flavorful. Different from fried spring rolls - these are fresh and delicate. Great appetizer! 🥗✨', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Popiah%20Malaysia'),
    ('Durian - King of Fruits', "👑🍈 LEGENDARY fruit! Love it or hate it - you MUST try! Creamy, custard-like flesh with intense aroma. Musang King variety is premium. Banned in hotels due to smell, but utterly addictive! Malaysia produces world's best! 💛🔥", 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Durian%20Stall%20Malaysia'),
    ('Murtabak', '🥞🍖 Stuffed savory pancake! Crispy layered bread filled with spiced minced meat, onions, and egg. Served with curry dipping sauce. From mamak stalls, available day and night. Rich, satisfying, and delicious! 🌙🔥', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Murtabak%20Malaysia'),
    ('Sup Kambing', '🍲🐐 Hearty mutton soup! Rich, aromatic bone broth with tender mutton pieces, served with bread for dipping. Warming spices include cinnamon, star anise, cloves. Perfect rainy day comfort food! Available at mamak stalls 24/7! 🌧️❤️', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sup%20Kambing%20Malaysia'),
    ('Char Kway Teow', "🍜 The sizzle heard 'round Malaysia! Char Kway Teow bursts from scorching woks with the intensity of a thousand flames—flat rice noodles dancing with soy sauce, prawns snapping fresh, cockles adding ocean whispers, and bean sprouts providing crucial crunch. Chinese chives contribute their signature punch while eggs bind everything in silky richness. Traditionally served on banana leaves and cooked in aromatic pork lard, this Hokkien masterpiece rewards those who seek out the skilled hawkers whose woks have seasoned for decades. Warning: highly addictive!", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/food/char-kway-teow'),
    ('Chicken Rice', "🐔 Simplicity elevated to art! Hainanese Chicken Rice transforms humble ingredients into Malaysia's most beloved comfort meal. Silky poached chicken, impossibly tender, draped over fragrant oily rice cooked in chicken stock with ginger and pandan. The trio of sauces—fiery chili, pungent ginger paste, and dark soy—let you customize every bite. Steamed, roasted, or char-grilled—every version has devoted fans ready to defend their favorite. From humble hawker stalls to legendary restaurants, this dish proves that sometimes, the simplest foods steal your heart forever.", 'https://www.malaysia.travel/food/chicken-rice'),
]

# name, description, link
CARTOONS = [
    ('Upin and Ipin', "🎬 Meet Malaysia's most beloved twins! Upin & Ipin have captured hearts worldwide since 2007—two adorable kampung boys whose adventures teach valuable lessons wrapped in hilarious hijinks. Starting as a Ramadan special, these twins became cultural icons spanning 11+ seasons, a blockbuster movie (Geng: The Adventure Begins), and merchandise everywhere! Their simple village life, quirky friends, and heartwarming family moments make this Malaysia's longest-running animated series—proof that local stories have global appeal!", 'https://www.youtube.com/user/lescopaque'),
    ('BoboiBoy', "⚡ Elemental superpowers unleashed! BoBoiBoy transforms from ordinary kid to superhero with powers over fire, wind, lightning, earth, and more—plus the incredible ability to split into THREE versions of himself! Defending Earth from cocoa-hunting aliens (yes, really!), BoBoiBoy and friends Ying, Yaya, Gopal, and Fang deliver action-packed adventures that rival any international superhero cartoon. Animonsta Studios created Malaysia's first global animation hit—now streaming worldwide and proving Malaysian superheroes are seriously powerful!", 'https://www.youtube.com/monsta!'),
    ('Ejen Ali', "🕵️ Malaysia's youngest secret agent reporting for duty! Ejen Ali accidentally becomes a M.A.T.A. super-spy after bonding with I.R.I.S.—an advanced AI device that transforms him into an unlikely hero. This groundbreaking WAU Animation series combines sleek action sequences, brilliant storytelling, and cutting-edge 3D animation that rivals global studios. Ali's adventures balancing school, family, and saving Malaysia have earned critical acclaim and a devoted fanbase. The future of Malaysian animation starts here!", 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC42ZduLx6o3Nqg04kMuMCEw`'),
    ('Rimba Racer', "🏎️ Engines roar in Malaysia's first racing animated series! Rimba Racer follows Tag, a street-smart prodigy tearing through the Rimba Grand Prix against rivals who'll stop at nothing to win. This high-octane Glue Studios creation combines adrenaline-pumping races with compelling character development and stunning 3D animation. Each episode delivers new racing challenges, unexpected alliances, and the ultimate question: does Tag have what it takes to become champion? Buckle up—it's race day!", 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_hIm8ZLBh-0zdvrkI0vR6w'),
    ('Saladin: The Animated Series', "⚔️ The legendary Saladin rides into animation! This epic 13-part series brings the 12th-century Islamic hero Salah Al-Din to life through cutting-edge Malaysian animation. Watch the young warrior unite Muslims, battle Crusaders, and demonstrate timeless values of courage, justice, and leadership. Conceived by Malaysia's Multimedia Development Corporation, this ambitious project proves Malaysian animation can tackle historical epics with international quality. History's greatest warrior meets Malaysia's greatest animators!", 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W6D_N7d6QUE'),
    ('Harry & Bunnie', '🎩 Magic, mayhem, and magnificent slapstick! Harry & Bunnie delivers non-stop laughs as wannabe magician Harry tries (and hilariously fails) to impress friends with tricks—while his mischievous rabbit Bunnie steals the spotlight and his magic wand! Animasia Studio created 78 episodes of pure physical comedy requiring zero dialogue—just universal humor that translates across all languages and cultures. Now streaming on Netflix worldwide and Disney Channel Asia, this chase never gets old!', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AJ-HF5VcoWg'),
    ('Kisah Bawah Tanah', "💀👻 Malaysia's FIRST PG-13 animated horror-comedy! Meet Zack and Sam, two skeleton teens working at The Mart - a convenience store hiding an INTERDIMENSIONAL PORTAL! Missions through bizarre worlds crawling with myths, monsters, and Southeast Asian folklore (pontianaks, toyols!) - but with punchlines! 26 episodes, ~11 mins each. By Animasia Studio and Spaceboy Studios. Early 2026 premiere on Astro. Not your kids' cartoon - it's LEGENDARY! 🌀🎬", 'https://www.kisahbawahtanah.com'),
    ('ChaCha & Dina', "👧👧💕 Every Malaysian sibling relationship in cartoon form! ChaCha is mischievous, Dina is 'responsible' - together they're PURE CHAOS. Arguments, teasing, silly messes - but always having each other's backs. Watching this feels like stepping into a Malaysian living room: noisy, funny, full of love. Perfect family bonding on Astro Ceria and Sooka! If you grew up with siblings, you'll be pointing at the screen saying 'That's literally us!' 🏠❤️", 'https://www.astro.com.my'),
    ('Mechamato', "🤖⚡ Malaysia's GLOBAL SUPERHERO sensation! Amato meets MechaBot, an alien robot that transforms ANYTHING into a gadget - frying pans, skateboards, you name it! Together they fight villains and save the city with jaw-dropping inventions. From Monsta (creators of BoBoiBoy), this 3D CGI blockbuster tops charts worldwide! Available on Cartoon Network, Netflix Malaysia, and Youku China. Malaysia's superhero story the WORLD is watching! 🌍🦸", 'https://www.youtube.com/monstasocial'),
    ('Misteri di Sebalik Order', "🤖💕 Malaysia's FIRST AI-animated series! Cap, a capybara delivery rider, falls for Meknab, a rabbit - but this isn't your regular rom-com. Their romance twists into strange, mysterious turns! Built for TikTok with short, scroll-stopping episodes. Experimental, bold, and possibly the FUTURE of animation. By Media Prima's TV3. Watch exclusively on TikTok @aiseyymentv3_ - dropped September 2025! 📱✨", 'https://www.tiktok.com/@aiseyymentv3_'),
]

