    ('EQ Hotel KL', 'Luxury 5-Star', '🌿🏢 Sustainability meets style! This eco-conscious luxury hotel in Golden Triangle offers halal dining, stunning views, and modern comfort. Prayer room, Muslim-friendly service. Connected to Equatorial Plaza. Green luxury for conscious travelers! ♻️🌟', 'https://www.eqkualalumpur.com', 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/EQ%20Hotel%20Kuala%20Lumpur', 'Kuala Lumpur', '1.5 km', 3.1262, 101.6609),
